<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">-MLK - Bible Iyansi</book>
  <para style="h">MALAKƆ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ kàsön Malakɔ</para>
  <para style="toc2">MALAKƆ</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mlk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ kàsön</para>
  <para style="mt1">Malakɔ</para>
  <para style="imt">Nsɛmà</para>
  <para style="ip">Un'kaan Malakɔ wà bàfàtɛn sye naa Ywan kàsön wa. Nde kàkäl kàlak a Petɔlà anà un'baay a Pɔl. Akà baar abà bàbɔ̈ɔ̈l nde kàwɛl indiir mbɔɔn byà mfun ntɔn musɔn Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ lànde.</para>
  <para style="ip">Aŋuyɛnà mbɔɔn bàfàsi naa nde wa kàsön u Lɔma ntsü a mbul 63 a 68. Nde wa kàsön ntɔn baar mpa abà Ayudà.</para>
  <para style="ip">An'kyän ande manswà nde kàsi unsà isal a Yɛsu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ndaa ayuboo un'kaan awà ayi:</para>
  <para style="ip">- 1.1-13: Ngyöön a isal a Yɛsu, mbuur afwel, ndüümà anà ndɛb ande</para>
  <para style="ip">- 1.14-3.12: Nsɛmà a isal u Ngalilɛ, alɔŋki bàtàtwɛb, impà byàtàtwɛb, an'tɔɔn atàtwɛb, nswɛɛŋ mpa bàmɛɛy, ibyääl mpa bàyee</para>
  <para style="ip">- 3.13-6.6 Kiin a isal u Ngalilɛ, nsɔ̈ɔ̈l a antööm kwem aŋiyweel, ntöön yan'söönà anà mbaaŋ, indiir impà byà ikɔ̈b, nswɛɛŋ a nkääŋ a mpem anà ukɔɔn amɛɛy, mpem a bwoor</para>
  <para style="ip">- 6.6-8.26 Ngweel a isal u mii a baar u Ngalilɛ, Antööm bàkwem aŋiyweel.</para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1"/>
  <para style="s1">An'lɔɔŋ a Ywan Un'düümà</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Màt 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3.1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Ywn 1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1"/>Nsɛmà a Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ là Yɛsu Klistɔ, Mwan a Nzam: <verse eid="MRK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2"/>Uboo a un'kaan a ŋangɔɔm Yɛsay bàsön naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">« Le, mɛ an'tɔm un'kyeey amɛ kusà a ngye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">ntɔn mulɔn mbwo angye.<verse eid="MRK 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3"/>Ndaa mwɛy yàmusà in'kwɛŋ u nsye a ipɔl:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">Làlɔ̈n mbwo a Mwol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">làsuub myäy ande. »<verse eid="MRK 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4"/>Apan Ywan Un'düümà kàkàmɛnà u nsye a ipɔl, muyilɔŋ baar mubuul mpem anà muwal ndüümà, ntɔn badwääl nkul a man'be. <verse eid="MRK 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5"/>-Itiir a Yuday kyanswà anà baar a Yɛlusàlɛm banswà bàkyeenà akà nde, bàkyeyà man'be aba, waa nde kàfadümà u Yɔrdan.<verse eid="MRK 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6"/>Ywan kàkäl aŋàbwaar ipfɛy a in'kà a ntsür bàfàbel naa shamo anà un'kab a iban a ntsür kyàŋàkwam u lɔŋ ande. Nde kàdyee mpay anà bwey a nsye. <verse eid="MRK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7"/>Nde kàkyäänà naa: « Mbuur kàman'söön u ngwal wàmuyà ungö a mɛ. Mɛ in'kwo anki munye ntɔn mutsuuŋ in'siŋ a idyaar ande. <verse eid="MRK 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8"/>Mɛ, mɛ kàladümà kan'dà, wɛɛ nde, nde ayàladümà u Dweelà Inkyɛɛl. »<verse eid="MRK 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndüümà anà ndɛb a Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">Màt 3.13-4.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk 3.21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9"/>Yàmɛnà naa kà ilä abin Yɛsu kàfü Nasàlɛr u Ngalilɛ. Ywan kun'dümà u Yɔrdan. <verse eid="MRK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10"/>Pa kàtoo nde kan'dà, nde kàmɛn du làmudubà. Dweelà kàyàtyà udu a nde asànaa nkokà. <verse eid="MRK 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11"/>Ndaa yàfü du, yàtɛn naa: « Ngye awà Mwan amɛ wà nkween. Mpem amɛ yanswà ye amu ngye. »<verse eid="MRK 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12"/>Kà imbürà, Dweelà kun'siinà u nsye a ipɔl. <verse eid="MRK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13"/>Kwo, Satanà kun'lwɛb ilä an'kwem an'nà. Nde kàkälà anà ntsür a ndwaŋ, akyeey bun'syäälà.<verse eid="MRK 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isal a Yɛsu u Ngalilɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:14-22">Màt 4.14-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk 4.14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1">5.1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14"/>Ungö bàyälà ba Ywan, Yɛsu kàkyen Ngalilɛ. Kwo nde kàkyäänà Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ là Nzam anà mutɛn naa: <verse eid="MRK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15"/>« Taaŋ lan'kwo, Imwol a Nzam kyan'tol tsütsü. Làbuul mpem abɛ! Làsi làkwikilà amu Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ! »<verse eid="MRK 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16"/>Umpal kàkäl nde mulyäŋ kà un'kɔɔl a ɛwà a Ngalilɛ, nde kàmɛn Simɔn anà Andrɛ, un'tɔŋ a Simɔn, bàmutɔɔm an'kwen aba kà ɛwà: ba bàkäl alɔ̈ɔ̈b a nsö. <verse eid="MRK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17"/>Yɛsu kàtɛn a ba naa: « Yàlan'läb, waa mɛ in'yàlabuul alɔ̈ɔ̈b a baar. » <verse eid="MRK 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18"/>Apan sye, ba bàsàwɛy an'kwen aba, waa bun'läb. <verse eid="MRK 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19"/>Kàsin nde ikye, nde kàmɛn Zyak mwan a Zebeday anà un'tɔŋ ande Ywan. Ba bàkäl uboo a bwaar aba mulɔn an'kwen. <verse eid="MRK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20"/>Apan sye, nde waa kabel. Ba bàsàwɛy taaràba Zebeday uboo a bwaar anà baar a isal, waa bun'läb.<verse eid="MRK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Baal kàkäl anà dweelà a làbe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luk 4.31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21"/>Yɛsu anà alɔŋki ande ban'bilà u Kapɛrnawum. Apan sye, ilä a saba, nde kàbilà u ndwà a nköŋ a Ayudà, waa kàlɔɔŋà. <verse eid="MRK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22"/>Baar bàkäl mubem an'lɔɔŋ ande, ntɔn nde kàlɔɔŋà asànaa mbuur awe anà ikɔ̈b, wɛɛ kà asànaa alɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn anki. <verse eid="MRK 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23"/>Kyekà uboo a ndwà a nköŋ a Ayudà akun, mbuur mwey kàkäl anà dweelà a làbe, nde kàsi in'kwɛŋ: <verse eid="MRK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24"/>« Yɛsu, un'nsi Nasàlɛr, ininà ngye akwen akà bi? Nkye ngye ayi ntɔn muböŋ bi? Mɛ in'kyàyöb naa ngye awà nà: ngye awà Ŋun'kyeel a Nzam! » <verse eid="MRK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25"/>Yɛsu kun'swɛŋ a ngwal naa: « Kal a duu! Too uboo a mbuur wà! » <verse eid="MRK 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26"/>Dweelà a làbe waa làtoo, lun'nini, làmuyisà un'kwɛŋ a kölàköl. <verse eid="MRK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27"/>Baar banswà bàkäl mubem, waa bàsyeelà mbaaŋ ba a ba naa: « Ndaa nà ayi? An'lɔɔŋ akün màŋàyɔl a ikɔ̈b! Nde wàmuswaŋ an'dweelà an'be a ngwal, ma sye màmukun'wem! » <verse eid="MRK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28"/>Làsaŋ a nde làpää agyägyä kà itiir a nsi a Ngalilɛ kyanswà.<verse eid="MRK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'kɔɔr abɛy mbɔɔn</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Màt 8.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk 4.38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29"/>Pa bàtoo ba u ndwà a nköŋ a Ayudà, ba bàkyen anà Zyak anà Ywan u ndwà a Simɔn anà Andrɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30"/>Kyekà ukwà a Simɔn wun'kaar kàkäl aŋàbɔ̈ɔ̈n ntɔn nde kàkäl anà làbwey a mpye. Apan sye, ba bàsam Yɛsu ntɔn nde. <verse eid="MRK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31"/>Nde kàsin tsütsü, kun'käär u kɔɔ, waa kun'mbaar. Làbwey a mpye waa làtoo, nde waa kàsɛmà mukasyääl.<verse eid="MRK 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32"/>Làsisye, ungö a miinà a taaŋ, ba bun'twäälà baar an'kyal banswà anà baar bàkäl anà an'dweelà an'be. <verse eid="MRK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33"/>Bul lanswà làyàköŋ u munàmbwo. <verse eid="MRK 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34"/>Yɛsu kàkɔɔr baar mbɔɔn bàkäl anà an'kyal a ifà ifà. Nde kàtwey sye insɔŋà mbɔɔn. Nde kàwɛy anki mbwo akà insɔŋà musà ndaa. Ntɔn mya, mya myàkyun'yöbà.<verse eid="MRK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'lyaaŋ u Ngalilɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luk 4.42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35"/>Ututu tutu, Yɛsu kàsubà nde, kàtoo u ndwà, waa kàkyen u mpey. Akun nde kàkäl muyamà. <verse eid="MRK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36"/>Simɔn anà baar bamwey bàkäl anà nde bàkyer akun'leŋ. <verse eid="MRK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37"/>Utaaŋ bun'mɛn ba, ba bàtɛn a nde naa: « Baar banswà bàmuyaleŋ. » <verse eid="MRK 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38"/>Yɛsu kafuur naa: « Tsweenà ikal asin, kan'bul a tsütsü, ntɔn mɛ in'kàkyään sye Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ kwo. Mɛ, mɛ kàtoo ntɔn la. » <verse eid="MRK 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39"/>Nde waa kàyilyaaŋà u Ngalilɛ wanswà mulɔŋ uboo a ndwà a nköŋ a Ayudà anà muböŋ insɔŋà.<verse eid="MRK 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'pööŋ ŋukyal a bay</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Màt 8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40"/>Yàmɛnà naa ŋukyal a bay mwɛy kàsin apà nde, kàbü an'köm, waa kàtɛn naa: « Kya ngye akyàkwen, ngye an'kwo an'pöŋ. » <verse eid="MRK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41"/>Yɛsu kun'wɛm ngyɛb mbɔɔn, kàsɛn kɔɔ, kun'bä, waa kàtɛn naa: « Mɛ an'kwen, pɔŋà! » <verse eid="MRK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42"/>Umbalà mwɛy bay waa làlwomà, nde waa kàpɔŋà. <verse eid="MRK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43"/>Apan, Yɛsu kun'fuur ndwà ande, <verse eid="MRK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44"/>ungö mukun'pà nswɛɛŋ yi: « Twon an'sam ndaa ayi akà mbuur mwɛy. Wɛɛ ngye, kyɛn kamɛnà akà ngaŋ, waa akàpà an'kab a mpööŋ asànaa kàlɔ̈m Mɔsɛ, ntɔn mukaswaŋ naa ngye an'kɔrà. » <verse eid="MRK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45"/>Pa kàkyen nde, nde kàsɛmà mukyään u ndaa a ngwal anà mupay làsaŋ a ndaa ayi. Kyakin Yɛsu kàmɛn anki mbwo mukàmɛnà u mii a baar banswà kan'bul an'köl an'köl, wɛɛ nde kàkälà u nsà, u mpey. Waa baar bàfwee mper anà mper, bàyee akà nde.<verse eid="MRK 1:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'kɔɔr mbuur aŋàkwɛkà</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Màt 9.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5.17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1"/>Ungö a ilä, Yɛsu kàfurà Kapernawum. Làsaŋ làpää naa nde kàkäl u ndwà. <verse eid="MRK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2"/>Baar mbɔɔn bàyàköŋ paa. Akà ikal kyàkäl anki, itàkal tsütsü a munàmbwo a ndwà. Ikal kyàfàkal anki, itàkal u nsà. Nde kakyäänà Ndaa. <verse eid="MRK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3"/>Apan, baar bun'twääl mbuur aŋàkwɛkà. <verse eid="MRK 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4"/>Wɛɛ ba bàkwe anki mukun'twaal kà ikal kàkäl nde ntɔn baar bàkäl mbɔɔn, ba bàmɛn nsyä udu a ikal kàkäl nde, waa bàpfuul mun ntɔn mutyeey ipɔy kàkäl mbuur aŋàkwɛkà. <verse eid="MRK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5"/>Mpal kàmɛn Yɛsu làkwikilà aba, nde kàtɛn a mbuur aŋàkwɛkà naa: « Mwan amɛ, mɛ amadwääl nkul a man'be angye. » <verse eid="MRK 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6"/>Alɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn amwɛy bàkäl aŋàbwaay paa, bàmuyweerà u mpem aba naa: <verse eid="MRK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7"/>« Ntɔn nkye mbuur wà kan'tɛn nde abwɛy? Nde wàmubɛy Nzam. Nà kan'kwo mudwa nkul a man'be isàkal naa kà Nzam mpɛl anki? » <verse eid="MRK 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8"/>Abà kàyöb nde unsà dweelà ande ndaa bayweerà ba uboo a ba ŋakwo, Yɛsu kàtɛn a ba naa: « Ntɔn nkye làbà bɛ anà an'kyän atub amà u mpem abɛ? <verse eid="MRK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9"/>Undiir nà akɔ̈ɔ̈n mpay mutɛn akà mbuur aŋàkwɛkà: "Bàmadwääl nkul a man'be angye", lɛɛ mutɛn naa: "Mbarà, sɛn ipɔy angye, kyen"? <verse eid="MRK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10"/>Abun, ntɔn bɛ làyöb naa Mwan a mbuur wɛ anà ikɔ̈b mudwääl baar nkul a man'be u mɛɛn pà. » Apan, nde kàtɛn a mbuur aŋàkwɛkà naa: <verse eid="MRK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11"/>« Mɛ amaswaŋ, mbarà, sɛn ipɔy angye, kyen ndwà angye! » <verse eid="MRK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12"/>Baal awà waa kàmbarà, apan sye nde kàsɛn ipɔy ande, waa kàtoo u mii a baar banswà. Apan ba banswà bàmɛn ndaa yubem, waa bàsyäŋà Nzam, bàtɛɛnà naa: « Bi ŋàtàman anki abà akà ikikye! »<verse eid="MRK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'bel Lɛvi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Màt 9.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5.27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13"/>Yɛsu kàfàkyà kà un'kɔɔl a ɛwà. Un'sɛŋ a baar wanswà kàkyeenà akà nde, waa nde kalɔɔŋà. <verse eid="MRK 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14"/>Umpal kàkäl nde mulyaŋ, nde kàmɛn Lɛvi, mwan a Alfɛ, kan'bwaay kà ikàl bàfàfur itɛr, waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Yan'läb! » Nde waa kàmbarà, waa kun'läb. <verse eid="MRK 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15"/>Ungö apan Yɛsu kàkàdyà u ndwà a Lɛvi. Afüür a itɛr mbɔɔn anà baar abe bàdyee mɛsà mwɛy anà nde, anà alɔŋki ande sye. Ntɔn baar abe bàkäl mbɔɔn muyun'lab. <verse eid="MRK 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16"/>Uboo a alɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn bàkäl anà Amfarisi. Mpal bàmɛn ba naa Yɛsu akadyaa ikal imwɛy anà baar abà banswà, ba bàtɛn a alɔŋki ande naa: « Abà aben? Ntɔn nkye udyaa nde anà afüür a itɛr anà baar abe? » <verse eid="MRK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17"/>Yɛsu kàwem nde abwey, nde kàtɛn a ba naa: « Kà baar abye anà ngwal u ndür anki abye anà mfun a un'ngaŋ, wɛɛ aŋakyal. Mɛ kàyi anki mubel baar a balàbal, wɛɛ baar abe. »<verse eid="MRK 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu anà nkin a mbɔr</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Màt 9.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5.33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18"/>Ilä mwɛy alɔŋki a Ywan anà Amfarisi bàkäl mukin mbɔr. Ba bàyàtɛn a Yɛsu naa: « Ntɔn nkye bi alɔŋki a Ywan anà alɔŋki a Amfarisi ifàkin mbɔr, wɛɛ alɔŋki angye mbɔr bàfàkin anki? » <verse eid="MRK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19"/>Yɛsu kafuur naa: « Nkye baar ban'bel kà un'kyɔm atà bɔr ban'kwo mukin mbɔr umpal awà un'tɛɛl a bɔr paa? Umpal awà un'tɛɛl a bɔr anà ba, ba bàkwo anki mukin mbɔr. <verse eid="MRK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20"/>Wɛɛ ilä ikyer asàyà, umpal bàsàlwom ba un'tɛɛl a bɔr uboo a ba, ba bàsàkin mbɔr ilä akin.<verse eid="MRK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21"/>« Akà mbuur mwɛy ukwe anki mubaay ikaam a ipfɛy akün udu a ipfɛy aŋànün, naa tɛy, ikaam akün ban'kwɛy iyànaan yar a ipfɛy aŋanün, tuun waa làyàyàmà. <verse eid="MRK 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22"/>Akà mbuur mwɛy ukwe anki musà man akün u mbeen aŋanün, naa tɛy, man akün laa ipfuul ma mbeen aŋanün, laa ipää ma: man anà mbeen sye waa ikyà bwà. Aay, akà man akün, mbeen sye yàkün! »<verse eid="MRK 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu anà saba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Màt 12.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23"/>Yàmɛnà naa ilä a saba mwɛy, Yɛsu kàkäl mulyaaŋ uboo a an'ywaŋ a blɛ. Alɔŋki ande bàsɛmà mubwo imfà u mbwo bayikyeenà ba. <verse eid="MRK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24"/>Amfarisi bàtɛɛnà a nde naa: « Ler ndaa bàkyerà ba ilä a saba! Yà ikin. » <verse eid="MRK 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25"/>Waa nde kafuur naa: « Nkye bɛ làtäŋ anki akà ikikye ndaa kàkyer David umpal kàkäl nde u làkɔɔŋ anà kàwem nde ngyal, nde anà baar bàkäl anà nde? <verse eid="MRK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26"/>Aben, umpal kàkäl Abyatar undweer a angaŋ, kàbilà nde u ndwà a Nzam, kàwɛl nde mampà bàfàpà ibɔɔn, kàdi nde ma anà kàpɛ nde baar bàkäl anà nde, itàkal naa ma angaŋ mpɛl bàfàdyà? » <verse eid="MRK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27"/>Apan, Yɛsu kàtɛɛnà a ba naa: « Saba bàkyer ntɔn mbuur, wɛɛ kà mbuur anki ntɔn saba. <verse eid="MRK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28"/>Kyakin, Mwan a mbuur wà nkum itàkal sye wà saba. »<verse eid="MRK 2:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Baal aŋàkwɛkà kɔɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Màt 12.9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6.6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1"/>Ungö, Yɛsu kàfàbilà u ndwà a nköŋ a Ayudà. Uboo kwo kàkäl anà baal mwɛy wàŋàkwɛkà kɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2"/>Baar bàkäl musey Yɛsu ntɔn muyöb naa nkye nde akyer un'kɔɔr ilä a saba, ntɔn ba bun'füün. <verse eid="MRK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3"/>Nde waa kàtɛn a baal aŋàkwɛkà kɔɔ naa: « Mbarà! yà uboboo pà. » <verse eid="MRK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4"/>Apan nde kàtɛn a ba naa: « Nkye bàkyàpà mbwo ilä a saba mukyer yàŋàbwaŋ lɛɛ yà ube, mutswà mɔ̈ɔ̈ lɛɛ mudwa? » Wɛɛ ba bàkäl a kul. <verse eid="MRK 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5"/>Kyakin Yɛsu kaler nde intwɛn, kawem nde ngyɛb sye ntɔn mpem ambe aba, waa kàtɛn a baal awun naa: « Sɛn kɔɔ a ngye. » Nde waa kàsɛn la, la waa làkɔɔrà. <verse eid="MRK 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6"/>Pa bàtoo Amfarisi, laa bàkàköŋ ba anà baar a Ɛlɔdi ntɔn ba bàleŋ mbwo mudwa Yɛsu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu anà un'sɛŋ a baar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7"/>Yɛsu kàkyen u mpey anà alɔŋki ande kà un'kɔɔl a ɛwà. Un'kàbɔ a baar bàfü Yɛlusàlɛm anà itiir a nsi a Ngalilɛ, Yuday, <verse eid="MRK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8"/>Idumɛ, u sim a ngyäl a Yɔrdan, Tir anà Sidɔn, bàyi akà Yɛsu ntɔn bàwem ba làsaŋ a indiir byanswà kàkyerà nde. <verse eid="MRK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9"/>Nde kàswɛŋ alɔŋki ande naa ba bun'lɔ̈ɔ̈n bwaar làmwɛy ntɔn baar bàkɔɔn akun'sà un'süküün. <verse eid="MRK 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10"/>Ntɔn kàkɔɔrà nde baar mbɔɔn, baar banswà bàkäl anà mpay u ndür bun'bweelà ntɔn mukun'ba. <verse eid="MRK 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11"/>Apan sye an'dweelà an'be, mpal mun'mɛnà ma, ma mun'bweelà kà in'kɔl, waa bun'syee in'kwɛŋ naa: « Ngye awà Mwan a Nzam! » <verse eid="MRK 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12"/>Wɛɛ nde katsüŋ a ngwal naa ba bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n un'mɛɛy.<verse eid="MRK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'sɔɔl antööm kwem aŋiyweel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Màt 10.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13"/>Ungö, Yɛsu kàbeenà udu a mɔŋ, kàbel baar kàkwen nde. Ba bàyi apà nde. <verse eid="MRK 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14"/>Nde kàkyer itsuŋ a baar kwem aŋiyweel ntɔn muyikal anà nde anà mukatɔm mukàlɔŋ <verse eid="MRK 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15"/>anà ikɔ̈b muböŋ insɔŋà. <verse eid="MRK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16"/>Le, Bàkwem Aŋiyweel ba abà: Simɔn, Yɛsu kun'pɛ ikɔb a Petɔlà, <verse eid="MRK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17"/>Zyak, mwan a Zebeday anà un'tɔŋ ande Ywan. Nde ba kapɛ ikɔb a Bwanɛrgɛsi, iswaŋà naa « baar abà asànaa idum », <verse eid="MRK 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18"/>Andrɛ, Filipo, Bàtɛlàmay, Màtay, Tuma, Zyak mwan a Alfɛ, Tadɛ, Simɔn mbuur a mankay, <verse eid="MRK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19"/>anà Yudas Iskalyɔt, nde awun sye mbuur kun'yälà.<verse eid="MRK 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu anà baar a ywar ande</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20"/>Ungö apan Yɛsu kàyi u ndwà mwɛy. Un'sɛŋ a baar kàfàkàköŋ kwo, lalan ba bàsàkwo anki itàkal mudyà. <verse eid="MRK 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21"/>Mpal bàwem baar a ywar ande abwɛy, ba bàyi mukun'lwom, ntɔn ba bàtɛɛnà naa: « Nde kan'yiŋ! »<verse eid="MRK 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu anà Bɛlzebul</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Màt 12.22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11.14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12.10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22"/>Alɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn bàyàtyà fà Yɛlusàlɛm bàtɛɛnà naa: « Bɛlzebul wà uboo ande! » Anà sye naa: « Nde insɔŋà ayibɔ̈ŋ u mbwo a mfum a insɔŋà! » <verse eid="MRK 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23"/>Apan Yɛsu waa kabel, waa kàtɛn a ba unsà nsim naa: « Nkye Satanà kan'kwo uböŋ Satanà? <verse eid="MRK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24"/>Isàkal naa imwol mwɛy kyàŋàkaabà anà kya ŋakwo, imwol akin ifàtsim anki. <verse eid="MRK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25"/>Isàkal naa ywar mwɛy làŋàkaabà anà la ŋakwo, ywar alan làfàtsim anki. <verse eid="MRK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26"/>Kya Satanà usànwan anà nde ŋakwo, nde wàŋàkaabà, nde utsim anki, yànde yan'wà.<verse eid="MRK 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27"/>« Akà mbuur mwey ukwe anki mubilà u ndwà a ŋangwal anà ugyɔɔr indiir ande, isàkal naa nde ŋàtun'bäm anki ŋangwal awun in'siŋ. Manà nde kàmubäm in'siŋ, apan laa ugyɔɔr nde indiir byanswà abyà uboo a ndwà ande. <verse eid="MRK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28"/>Ndandaa mɛ alàkyään, baan a baar bàkyer asadwääl nkul a ndaa aba yanswà: man'be anà mbɛɛy mbɔɔn isàtoo u mun aba. <verse eid="MRK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29"/>Wɛɛ mbuur asàbɛy Dweelà In'kyɛɛl, nde bàsun'dwääl anki nkul akà ikikye. Ntɔn ube ande bà bàmbul a in'tye. »<verse eid="MRK 3:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30"/>Yɛsu kàtɛɛnà nde abwɛy ntɔn ba bàtɛɛnà naa: « Nde we anà dweelà a làbe. »<verse eid="MRK 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngwän anà atɔŋ a Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Màt 12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31"/>Ngwän anà atɔŋ a Yɛsu bàyi anà bàmbär u nsà, waa bàtöm mbuur mukun'bel. <verse eid="MRK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32"/>Un'sɛŋ a baar kàkäl aŋàbwaay apà ande. Waa bàtɛn a nde naa: « Le, ngwa anà atɔŋ angye babaal anà bakaar bàmukaleŋà u nsà. » <verse eid="MRK 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33"/>Nde kafuur naa: « Maa anà atɔŋ amɛ bànà? » <verse eid="MRK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34"/>Apan, nde kàler baar bàkäl aŋàbwaay apà nde, waa kàtɛn naa: « Làler maa anà atɔŋ amɛ! <verse eid="MRK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35"/>Mbuur wanswà afàsyääl ukwen a Nzam, nde wà un'tɔŋ amɛ wàbaal, un'tɔŋ amɛ wà un'kaar anà maa. »<verse eid="MRK 3:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Nsim a un'köön</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Màt 13.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8.4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1"/>Yɛsu kàfàsɛmà mulɔŋ kà un'kɔɔl a ɛwà. Un'sɛŋ a baar mbɔɔn kàköŋ tsütsü apà nde, lalan kàbilà nde u bwaar, la làkäl udu a an'dà, waa kàbwaay. Baar banswà bàkäl u mɛɛn, usà ntsü akà an'dà. <verse eid="MRK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2"/>Nde ba kalɔɔŋà indiir mbɔɔn unsà nsim. Nde kàtɛɛnà a ba unsà an'lɔɔŋ ande naa: <verse eid="MRK 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3"/>« Làwem. Le, un'köön kàtoo mukɔn. <verse eid="MRK 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4"/>Umpal kàyimwaŋà nde, yar a mbɛŋ làmwɛy làbü u mbwo: nɛn waa yàyi, waa yàdi ya. <verse eid="MRK 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5"/>Yar lumwɛy làbü kà ikal kyàkäl anà in'kul, mɛɛn a mbɔɔn màkäl anki. La làtoo agyàgyà ntɔn mɛɛn màkäl anki mbɔɔn u ngyɛl. <verse eid="MRK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6"/>Mpal kàbalà mwäänà, laa làkuŋà la, waa làyöm ntɔn ukɔɔn in'swɛy. <verse eid="MRK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7"/>Lumwɛy làbü uboo a nsyeenà. Nsyeenà yàyɛl ya, ya waa yun'fwee, la waa mpa làtwey mbɛŋ. <verse eid="MRK 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8"/>Mbɛŋ yumwɛy yàbü uboo a mɛɛn aŋàbwaŋ, waa yàmɛn, yàyɛl, yàbör mbɛŋ mbɔɔn: imwɛy an'kwem an'tär, imwɛy an'kwem an'syaam, imwɛy nkam. » <verse eid="MRK 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9"/>Nde kàtɛɛnà naa: « Wɛy mbuur awe anà an'tsü awem, uwem! »<verse eid="MRK 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntɔn nkye Yɛsu ufàsyääl nde nsim</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Màt 13.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk 8.9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10"/>Mpal kàkäl Yɛsu u mpey, baar bàyun'labà anà Bàkwem Aŋiyweel, bun'fuulà ntɔn nsim. <verse eid="MRK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11"/>Nde kàtɛɛnà a ba naa: « Akà bɛ, ngyee a Imwol a Nzam bàkyàlapà. Wɛɛ akà baar abà u nsà, indiir byanswà byàfàlyaŋ unsà nsim, <verse eid="MRK 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12"/>ntɔn abun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">"itàkal naa ba bàkyer aleerà, ba bàkɔɔn aman,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">itàkal naa ba bàkyer aweemà, ba bàkɔɔn ayöb,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">manà ba bàyàbuul mpem anà bàyadwääl un'pi a nkul!" »<verse eid="MRK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu wàmubuul nsim a un'köön</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Màt 13.18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk 8.11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13"/>Nde kàfàtɛn a ba naa: « Bɛ, bɛ làyöb anki nsim ayi! Abun bɛ làyàyöb aben nsim yanswà? <verse eid="MRK 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14"/>"Un'köön" kan'kɔn Ndaa. <verse eid="MRK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15"/>Le, baar abà u mbwo, kà ikal bàkön Ndaa: mpal bàwem ba, Satanà abwà ayà, waa ulwom Ndaa bàkön uboo aba. <verse eid="MRK 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16"/>Bumwɛy bakön udu a nkɔŋ: bà baar, mpal bàfàwem ba Ndaa, ba bàbwà awal ya unsà un'sak. <verse eid="MRK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17"/>Wɛɛ uboo a ba in'swɛy myatɛy, ba bà baar a ansɔŋà: isàkal naa lingyoomà lan'yà itàkal nkwaaŋ ntɔn Ndaa, laa bàbwà ba. <verse eid="MRK 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18"/>Bumwɛy bakön uboo a nsyeenà: bà baar bàwem Ndaa, <verse eid="MRK 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19"/>wɛɛ nkyän a mɛɛn, untaam a in'naaŋ anà ngyal a indiir asin asin byàbilà bya, laa iküünà bya Ndaa, ya waa mpa ibɔr mbɛŋ. <verse eid="MRK 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20"/>Bumwɛy bakön u mɛɛn aŋàbwaŋ. Ba bà baar bàfàwem Ndaa, bàfàwal ya, waa bàfàbɔr mbɛŋ: imwɛy an'kwem an'tär, imwɛy an'kwem an'syaam, imwɛy nkam. »<verse eid="MRK 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsim a mwinà</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luk 8.16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21"/>Yɛsu kàtɛn a ba naa: « Nkye mwinà afàyà ntɔn musà ungyɛl a kantin itàkal ungyɛl a itäb? Nkye kà ntɔn mutɔl udu a ikɔlà a un'te a wa anki? <verse eid="MRK 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22"/>Ntɔn undiir mwɛy wàŋàyee watɛy mpa usàmɛnà u mii, ndaa mwɛy yànkuu yatɛy mpa isàmɛnà u mwäänà. <verse eid="MRK 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23"/>Wɛy mbuur awe anà an'tsü awem, uwem! » <verse eid="MRK 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24"/>Nde waa kàfàtɛn a ba naa: « Làkäl kà igyɛɛŋ ntɔn ndaa làkaweemà bɛ. Làsii làsyäälà bɛ musi, làsii nsil alan bàsàsyääl akà bɛ, la làsàkal aŋàkwɛy ntɔn bɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25"/>Ntɔn bàsàpà akà mbuur awɛ anà undiir, wɛɛ akà mbuur mpa awe anà undiir, bàsàlwom itàkal undiir ufàsi nde mukal anà wa. »<verse eid="MRK 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsim a imbɛŋ kyàmɛn anà kyàyɛl kya ŋakwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26"/>Nde kàfàtɛn a ba naa: « Imwol a Nzam kyà asànaa mbuur mwɛy kan'mwaŋ nkɔɔn u mɛɛn. <verse eid="MRK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27"/>Nde utàkal aŋàbɔ̈ɔ̈n, utàkal wàŋàwiyà, mpib anà mwäänà, nkɔɔn yan'mɛn anà yan'yɛl, nde uyöb anki naa yà aben. <verse eid="MRK 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28"/>Mɛɛn ma ŋakwo màfàtàtwey bite, ungö imfà, ungö apan mbɛŋ aŋàkɔlà yan'yööl imfà. <verse eid="MRK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29"/>Pa isöŋ mbɛŋ, ba bàsà impye, ntɔn la paŋà abwo. »<verse eid="MRK 4:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsim a imbɛŋ ikikye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Màt 13.31-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30"/>Yɛsu kàfàtɛn naa: « Ininà bi kan'kwo musi a Imwol a Nzam, itàkal naa nsim nà bi kan'kwo mutà ntɔn muswaŋ kya? <verse eid="MRK 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31"/>Kya kyà asànaa imbɛŋ ikikye bàkön u mɛɛn. Kya kyan'söön ukye uboo a mbɛŋ yanswà ayà u mɛɛn. <verse eid="MRK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32"/>Wɛɛ isàkal naa ban'kɔn kya, kya kyan'laar, kyan'bulà aŋàsöön ndon yanswà uboo a làpaŋ, waa isà an'kɔkà. Apan, nɛn a du waa iyàtɔŋ an'yaab. »<verse eid="MRK 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33"/>Yà u mbwo a nsim mbɔɔn a tub ayi nde kàkyäänà Ndaa, ntɔn baar bàkäl kà isii ban'kwo ba mukun'wem. <verse eid="MRK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34"/>Nde kàyäämà anki anà ba ukɔɔn asyääl nsim, wɛɛ nde kàbuulà ya yanswà akà alɔŋki ande u mpey.<verse eid="MRK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'kwaam ikül</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:18">Màt 8.18</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8.22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35"/>Ilä nsil kya, làsisye, Yɛsu kàtɛn a alɔŋki ande naa: « Tsweenà bi isabà. » <verse eid="MRK 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36"/>Ba bàsàwɛy un'sɛŋ a baar, waa bun'syen uboo a bwaar kàkäl nde, an'bwaar asin màkäl tsütsü apà nde. <verse eid="MRK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37"/>Ikül laa kyàyi kya. Ibɔ a an'dà byàbilà uboo a bwaar, waa byàyöölà la. <verse eid="MRK 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38"/>Wɛɛ akà nde, nde kàkäl aŋàbɔ̈ɔ̈n kà ita a bwaar, un'tswe udu a ibɔm. Alɔŋki ande bun'wiy, waa bàsi in'kwɛŋ: « Un'lɔɔŋ, nkye ngye ube amanà anki naa bi ikü? » <verse eid="MRK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39"/>Yɛsu waa kàsubà, kàŋän ikül, waa kàtɛn a ɛwà naa: « Kal akul! Bäm mun! » Ikül laa kyàkwamà kya, duu a kölàköl waa làbilà. <verse eid="MRK 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40"/>Apan nde kàtɛn a ba naa: « Ntɔn nkye làbà bɛ mutɛɛr? Nkye bɛ ŋàtàsà anki làkwikilà? » <verse eid="MRK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41"/>Matɛɛr mawɛl ma, ba waa bàtɛɛnà ba a ba naa: « Abà nde wà nà, waa itàkal ikül anà ɛwà byàmukun'weemà? »<verse eid="MRK 4:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'kɔɔr aŋadweelà an'be</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Màt 8.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8.26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1"/>Ungö apan ba bàkɔlà u sim lumwɛy là ɛwà, u nsi a Bàngɛlàsà. <verse eid="MRK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2"/>Pa kàtoo Yɛsu u bwaar, baal mwɛy wàŋàyɔl a an'dweelà an'be kàyàtoo kà an'dii, waa kàyàbwey anà nde. <verse eid="MRK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3"/>Nde kàfabwaayà kà an'dii. Akà mbuur mwɛy kàfàkwo anki mukun'bäm itàkal dwaaŋ. <verse eid="MRK 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4"/>Ntɔn mbalà mbɔɔn ba bàfun'bäämà iswɛɛy anà dwaaŋ, wɛɛ nde kàtsüülà mya. Akà mbuur mwɛy kàkwe anki mukun'kyäämà. <verse eid="MRK 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5"/>Taaŋ lanswà, mpib anà mwäänà, nde kàkäl muyità nsay uboo a an'dii anà u myɔŋ, wàmuyikuub in'kwɛŋ anà muyikàkaam ndür a in'kul. <verse eid="MRK 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6"/>Umpal kàmɛn nde Yɛsu ukwɛl, nde kàkyen ntiin, waa kàbü an'köm kusà a nde, <verse eid="MRK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7"/>waa kàkuub in'kwɛŋ anà mutɛn naa: « Ininà akà mɛ anà ngye, Yɛsu, Mwan a Nzam a Dudu? Mɛ amabɔɔn kà ikɔb a Nzam, twon aman'pà mpay! » <verse eid="MRK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8"/>Ntɔn Yɛsu kàtɛɛnà a nde naa: « Dweelà a làbe, too unsà mbuur wà! » <verse eid="MRK 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9"/>Nde kun'fuul naa: « Ikɔb angye nà? » Nde kun'fuur naa: « Ikɔb a mɛ "Un'kàbɔ", ntɔn bi ibà mbɔɔn. » <verse eid="MRK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10"/>Nde waa kun'bɔ̈ɔ̈nà mbɔɔn, ntɔn nde ukɔɔn akaböŋ u nsi ayin.<verse eid="MRK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11"/>Kyekà, mper akà mɔŋ, làkäl anà làböl a kölàköl là ngul làkäl muyidyà. <verse eid="MRK 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12"/>An'dweelà an'be màbɔ̈ɔ̈n Yɛsu naa: « Itöm uboo a ngul ntɔn bi ibilà amu ya! » <verse eid="MRK 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13"/>Yɛsu kapɛ mbwo. Apan laa màtoo ma, màbilà ma uboo a ngul, làböl, fà iköl a mɔŋ, làkàbwà kà ɛwà. Ya yàkäl isii a nsaab yweel, waa làminà. <verse eid="MRK 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14"/>Aseey a ngul batiin ba, ba bàkàpay làsaŋ uboo a bul anà kà itsuŋ a ndwà. Apan baar waa bàyi muman ndaa yàlyaaŋ. <verse eid="MRK 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15"/>Mpal bàyàtol ba tsütsü apà Yɛsu anà bàmɛn ba aŋadweelà an'be akyàbwaay, akyàbwaar anà akyàkal a duu, nde mbuur kàkäl anà Un'kàbɔ, ba bàmɛn bɔɔmà. <verse eid="MRK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16"/>Baar bàmɛn ya yanswà yàlyaŋ, ba bakyäänà ndaa yàbweel mbuur aŋadweelà an'be anà ngul. <verse eid="MRK 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17"/>Apan ba bàsɛmà mukun'bɔɔn naa nde ulwomà kà itiir a nsi aba. <verse eid="MRK 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18"/>Umpal kàkäl Yɛsu mubilà u bwaar, mbuur awà kàkäl anà an'dweelà an'be kun'lɔ̈ɔ̈m naa <verse eid="MRK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19"/>Yɛsu kun'pɛ anki mbwo, wɛɛ nde kàtɛn a nde naa: « Furà ndwà a ngye, ntsü akà atoŋ angye, waa akakyään ndaa yanswà kàmakyer Mwol unsà ngyɛb ande. » <verse eid="MRK 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20"/>Apan, baal awà kàkyen nde, nde kàsɛmà mukyään indiir a kölàköl byanswà kàkyer Yɛsu akà nde u Dɛkapɔl. Baar banswà bakyer abemà.<verse eid="MRK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwan a Zayirɔs wà un'kaar anà un'kaar kàbä ipfɛy a Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Màt 9.18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8.40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21"/>Mpal kàfurà Yɛsu sim lumwɛy u bwaar, un'sɛŋ a baar mbɔɔn kàyàkɔ̈ŋ apà nde. Nde kàkäl kà un'kɔɔl a ɛwà. <verse eid="MRK 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22"/>Apan umwɛy uboo a amfum a ndwà a nköŋ a Ayudà, ikɔb ande Zayirɔs, umpal kàmɛn nde Yɛsu, nde kàbü kà in'kɔl ande, <verse eid="MRK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23"/>waa kun'bɔ̈ɔ̈n mbɔɔn, mutɛn naa: « Mwan un'kye amɛ wà un'kaar wà tsütsü mukwà, yun'si an'kɔɔ ntɔn nde ukɔɔrà, uwü mɔ̈ɔ̈! » <verse eid="MRK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24"/>Yɛsu kàkyen mbwo mwɛy anà nde. Un'sɛŋ a baar mbɔɔn kàyun'labà, waa kàyun'bàbääbà.<verse eid="MRK 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25"/>Kyekà kàkäl anà un'kaar mwɛy kàyitoo an'kil mbul kwem aŋiyweel. <verse eid="MRK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26"/>Nde kàmɛn mpay mbɔɔn muyikyà akà ingaŋ mbɔɔn, kàmay indiir ande byanswà, ukɔɔn aman ubwaŋ. Wɛɛ ukyal ande bàkyer afàsöönà mbɔɔn. <verse eid="MRK 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27"/>Umpal kàwem un'kaar awà ndaa bàtɛɛnà baar ntɔn Yɛsu, nde kàkül ungö, uboo a un'sɛŋ a baar, waa kàbä ipfɛy ande. <verse eid="MRK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28"/>Ntɔn nde kàtɛɛnà nde ŋàkwo naa: « Isàkal naa mɛ in'tàba akà ipfɛy ande mpɛl, mɛ in'kyɛr awà mɔ̈ɔ̈. » <verse eid="MRK 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29"/>Taaŋ nsil alan sye an'kil ande waa màtsü mutoo, nde kàyöb u ndür ande naa nde kan'kɔɔrà unsà ukyal ande. <verse eid="MRK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30"/>Apan sye, Yɛsu waa kàyöb naa ngwal mwɛy yan'too u ndür ande, nde kàbulà uboboo a un'sɛŋ a baar, waa kàfuulà naa: « Nà kan'ba ipfɛy amɛ? » <verse eid="MRK 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31"/>Alɔŋki ande bàtɛɛnà a nde naa: « Ngye akimanà naa un'sɛŋ a baar wàmukabàbääbà, wɛɛ ngye afuulà naa: "Nà kàman'ba?" » <verse eid="MRK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32"/>Wɛɛ nde kàleerà umbil ande ntɔn muyöb naa un'kaar nà kan'kyer abà. <verse eid="MRK 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33"/>Apan, abà kàyöb un'kaar awun ndaa yun'yeel, unsà bɔɔmà anà matɛɛr, nde kàyàbwà kà in'kɔl a Yɛsu, waa kàtɛn a nde ndandaa yanswà. <verse eid="MRK 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34"/>Yɛsu kàtɛn a nde naa: « Mangwa, làkwikilà angye làmatswà mɔ̈ɔ̈. Kyen a duu, wɛy naa ngye akɔɔrà unsà ukyal angye. »<verse eid="MRK 5:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35"/>Nde kàkäl aŋàtàmay anki muyääm, umpal bàyi baar bàfü ndwà a mfum a ndwà a nköŋ a Ayudà, waa bàtɛn naa: « Mwan angye wà un'kaar kan'kwà. Ntɔn nkye mufàtwääl Un'lɔɔŋ nkwom? » <verse eid="MRK 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36"/>Wɛɛ Yɛsu kàsàlab anki ndaa ayi, waa kàtɛn a mfum a ndwà a nköŋ a Ayudà naa: « Twon an'man bɔɔmà, sà làkwikilà mpɛl. » <verse eid="MRK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37"/>Abun, nde kàpɛ anki mbwo akà mbuur mukun'swà, nà Petɔlà, Zyak, anà un'tɔŋ ande Ywan mpɛl. <verse eid="MRK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38"/>Ba ban'kɔlà u ndwà a mfum a ndwà a nköŋ a Ayudà. Yɛsu kan'man baar ban'kal udu udu, bàmulel, bàmusà in'kwɛŋ mbɔɔn. <verse eid="MRK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39"/>Nde kan'bilà, waa kan'tɛn a ba naa: « Ntɔn nkye minii ami anà ilel abi? Mwan kà wàŋàkwà anki, nde wàŋàbɔ̈ɔ̈n. » <verse eid="MRK 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40"/>Ba bàkyer un'sɛɛ. Wɛɛ nde kàtwey baar banswà, waa kàwɛl nà taarande anà ngwän a mwan anà baar bàyun'swà. Apan nde kan'bilà u suk kàkäl mwan. <verse eid="MRK 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41"/>Nde kan'tà kɔɔ a mwan mpi, waa kan'tɛn a nde naa: « Mwan un'kaar, mɛ amaswaŋ, wiyà! » <verse eid="MRK 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42"/>Apan sye, mwan un'kaar waa kàmbarà, waa kàsemà mukyà, - nde kàkäl ayà mbul kwem aŋiyweel. Apan, ba bàkäl unsà ubem mbɔɔn. <verse eid="MRK 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43"/>Yɛsu kaswɛŋ a ngwal naa akà mbuur mwɛy ukɔɔn ayöb, waa kàtɛn naa ba bun'pɛ isaa adyà.<verse eid="MRK 5:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Baar a Nasàlɛr ban'tɔn musà làkwikilà amu Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Màt 13.53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4.16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1"/>Yɛsu kàlwomà kà ikal akin, waa kan'yà bul ande, alɔŋki ande bàkäl mukun'lab. <verse eid="MRK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2"/>Ilä a saba, nde kàsɛmà mulɔŋ u ndwà a nköŋ a Ayudà. Baar mbɔɔn bàweemà nde bàkäl mubem, waa bàtɛɛnà naa: « Nde indiir abi byan'fà ken? Amà an'yeerà a nkye ifà bun'pɛ, waa an'kɔɔ ande ikakyerà isal a ngwal a ngwal a tub abi? <verse eid="MRK 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3"/>Nkye nde kà sharpantye anki, mwan a Màlye, un'tɔŋ a Zyak, anà Yɔsɛ, anà Yude, anà Simɔn? Nkye atɔŋ ande bakaar kà bà anki uboo a bi apà? » Kyakin bàbööl ba kyà ntɔn làkwikilà aba. <verse eid="MRK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4"/>Apan Yɛsu kàtɛɛnà a ba naa: « Ŋangɔɔm bàfun'bɛy nà u bul ande, u mbil ande anà u ndwà ande mpɛl. » <verse eid="MRK 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5"/>Nde kàsàkwo anki mukyer akà impà mwɛy kwo, wɛɛ nde kàsi nà an'kɔɔ udu a ndam a aŋatoo, waa kakɔɔr. <verse eid="MRK 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6"/>Nde kàbemà ntɔn mpa bàkäl ba anà làkwikilà.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 6:6">Ntööm atàtwɛb yà alɔŋki kwem aŋiyweel</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Màt 10.5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Ungö apan nde kàyilyaaŋà kan'bul a tsütsü muyilɔŋ. <verse eid="MRK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7"/>Nde kàbel Bàkwem Aŋiyweel, kàsɛmà mukatɔm abɔ̈ɔ̈l abɔ̈ɔ̈l, kapɛ ikɔ̈b udu a an'dweelà an'be, <verse eid="MRK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8"/>waa kaswɛŋ naa: « Twon lan'wal akà undiir mwɛy ntɔn mbwo, nà unsɔk mpɛl. Twon lan'wal isaa adyà, itàkal ngɔɔr, itàkal ngim uboo a un'di, <verse eid="MRK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9"/>wɛɛ làbwäär idyaar, twon lan'bwaar an'kàzak an'mɔ̈ɔ̈l. »<verse eid="MRK 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10"/>Nde kàfàtɛn a ba naa: « Isàkal naa kà ikal imwɛy, bɛ lan'bilà u ndwà mwɛy, làbwaay paa tii umpal làsàlwomà bɛ kà ikal akin. <verse eid="MRK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11"/>Isàkal naa kà ikal imwɛy bàlawɛl anki, bàlawem anki, làlwomà apan, làkɔɔb un'twà a in'kɔl abɛ. Kya isàkal imbäl ntɔn ba. » <verse eid="MRK 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12"/>Alɔŋki bàkyen ba, ba bàkyäänà naa baar bàkyer abuul mpem. <verse eid="MRK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13"/>Ba bàyiböŋà insɔŋà mbɔɔn, bàkiirà aŋatoo mbɔɔn may, waa bakɔɔrà.<verse eid="MRK 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkweel a Ywan Un'düümà</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-2">Màt 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9.7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14"/>Mfum Ɛlɔdi kàwem naa bàtaa Yɛsu din, ntɔn ikɔb ande kyàtoo làpaan. Baar bàtɛɛnà naa: « Ywan Un'düümà kan'wiyà kukwà! Undiir awun awà nde anà ikɔ̈b mukyer indiir a ngwal a ngwal. » <verse eid="MRK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15"/>Bumwɛy bàtɛɛnà naa: « Nde wà Ɛli. » Bamwey sye naa: « Nde wà ŋangɔɔm asànaa umwɛy uboo a aŋangɔɔm. » <verse eid="MRK 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16"/>Mpal kàwem Ɛlɔdi ndaa ayi, nde kàtɛɛnà naa: « Ywan akwà kàtsül mɛ un'tswe, kan'wiyà! »<verse eid="MRK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17"/>Abun, Ɛlɔdi kàswɛŋ mukɔr Ywan anà bun'si u bɔlokà, ntɔn kàbääl nde Ɛlɔdyas awà kàkäl un'kyay a un'tɔŋ ande Filipo. <verse eid="MRK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18"/>Ntɔn Ywan kàtɛɛnà a Ɛlɔdi naa: « Mbwo yatɛy ngye muwal un'kyay a un'tɔŋ angye! » <verse eid="MRK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19"/>Undiir awun Ɛlɔdyas kàyiiŋ nde Ywan, waa kàkweenà mukun'dwa. Wɛɛ nde kàsàkwo anki, <verse eid="MRK 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20"/>ntɔn Ɛlɔdi kàtiinà Ywan bɔɔmà, abà kàyöb nde naa nde wà mbuur a balàbal anà wà in'kyɛɛl, laa kun'tii nde. Mpal kun'wɛɛmà nde, ya yun'pää mpay mbɔɔn. Wɛɛ nde kàkweenà mukun'wɛm. <verse eid="MRK 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21"/>Kyekà, Ɛlɔdyas ipöl aŋàbwaŋ kàmɛn ilä a un'kyɔm a mböör a Ɛlɔdi. Nde awà kàpɛ udyà akà ayɔl ande anà amfum a aŋità ande, anà akà abyääl a Ngalilɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22"/>Mwan a Ɛlɔdyas wà un'kaar waa kàyàkyen. Ɛlɔdi anà baar kàbel nde bàmɛn un'sak mbɔɔn. Mfum kàtɛn a mwan un'kaar naa: « Lɔm undiir wanswà akwen ngye, mɛ in'kyer ayapà wa. » <verse eid="MRK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23"/>Nde kun'dyeel kyän naa: « Undiir wanswà ayàlɔm ngye, mɛ in'kyɛr ayapà, itàkal naa yar a mɛɛn a imfum amɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24"/>Mwan un'kaar kàtoo u ndwà, waa kàtɛn a ngwän naa: « Ininà mɛ in'lɔm? » Nde waa kàfuur naa: « Un'tswe a Ywan Un'düümà. » <verse eid="MRK 6:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25"/>Nde kàfurà agyägyä akà mfum, waa kun'lɔ̈ɔ̈m: « Mɛ in'kwen naa ngye an'pɛ agyägyä udu a làlɔŋà, un'tswe a Ywan Un'düümà! » <verse eid="MRK 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26"/>Mfum kàwem ngyɛb. Wɛɛ, ntɔn kyän ande anà baar kàbel nde, nde kàkwen anki utön mukun'pà. <verse eid="MRK 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27"/>Apan sye, mfum kàtöm un'seey mwɛy anà nswɛɛŋ mutwal un'tswe a Ywan Un'düümà. Un'seey kàkyen u bɔlokà, waa kàtsül un'tswe a Ywan, <verse eid="MRK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28"/>kàtwääl wa udu a làlɔŋà, waa kàpɛ wa akà mwan un'kaar. Waa mwan un'kaar kàpɛ wa akà ngwän. <verse eid="MRK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29"/>Mpal bàwem alɔŋki a Ywan làsaŋ alan, ba bàyàwal ndom ande, waa bàsi ya kan'dii mwɛy.<verse eid="MRK 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'dii a abaal nsaab tyeen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Màt 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Ywn 6.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30"/>Yàmɛnà naa mpal bàyàfurà antööm, ba bàkɔ̈ŋ apà Yɛsu, ba bun'sam ndaa yanswà bàkyer ba anà bàlɔɔŋà ba. <verse eid="MRK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31"/>Nde kàtɛn a ba naa: « Bɛ bumwɛy, làyi u mpey, làyöör ikye u nsye a ipɔl. » Ntɔn baar mbɔɔn bàkälà muyaa anà mukyeenà, waa ba bàkäl anki itàkal anà taaŋ mudyà. <verse eid="MRK 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32"/>Lalan bàkyen ba, ba mpɛl, uboo a bwaar u mpey, u nsye a ipɔl. <verse eid="MRK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33"/>Baar batääl mukyà, bàmbɔɔn laa bayöb ba. Apan, fà an'bul manswà, ba bàkyen ntiin ntiin kà in'kɔl, waa bàfweel kà ikal bàkwen ba mukyà.<verse eid="MRK 6:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34"/>Umpal katoo Yɛsu u bwaar, nde kàmɛn un'sɛŋ a baar mbɔɔn, ngyɛb waa yun'wɛl ntɔn ba, ntɔn ba bàkäl asànaa in'kɔk myakɔɔn aleer, waa kàsɛmà mukalɔŋ indiir mbɔɔn. <verse eid="MRK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35"/>Taaŋ làkyen mbɔɔn, alɔŋki bàsin apà Yɛsu, waa bàtɛn a nde naa: « Ikal ki kyà ipɔl, taaŋ sye lan'kyà mbɔɔn. <verse eid="MRK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36"/>Afuur baar bà, ba bàkyà u bitsuŋ a ndwà anà an'bul a tsütsü mukàsom isaa adyà. » <verse eid="MRK 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37"/>Wɛɛ nde kafuur naa: « Lapɛ udyà bɛ ŋakwo! » Ba bàtɛn a nde naa: « Nkye bi ikàsom mampà a itɛr a ngim nkam yweel ntɔn bi ipɛ ba udyà? » <verse eid="MRK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38"/>Nde waa utɛn a ba naa: « Mampà an'kwe bɛ làwe amà? Kàlaler! » Ungö muler, ba ban'tɛn naa: « An'tyeen, anà nsö yweel. » <verse eid="MRK 6:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39"/>Apan, nde kaswɛŋ naa ba bàsi baar banswà unsà an'kab bàŋàbwaay udu a un'lɛŋ un'bu. <verse eid="MRK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40"/>Baar bàbwaay unsà in'lwaaŋ a nkam anà myà an'kwem an'tyeen. <verse eid="MRK 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41"/>Yɛsu kàwɛl mampà man'tyeen anà nsö yàyweel, nde kàler u du, kàsaak ma, kàtsül ma, waa kàpɛ akalɔŋki ntɔn mukääb baar banswà. <verse eid="MRK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42"/>Ba banswà bàdi, waa bàyüür. <verse eid="MRK 6:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43"/>Ba bàsyen in'lwaŋ kwem aŋiyweel myàŋàyɔl a itiir a mampà anà byà nsö byàsäl. <verse eid="MRK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44"/>Baar bàdi mampà bàkäl abaal nsaab tyeen.<verse eid="MRK 6:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'kyà udu a ɛwà</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Màt 14.22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Ywn 6.15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45"/>Apan sye, Yɛsu kàswɛŋ alɔŋki ande mubilà u bwaar anà mufweel kusà a nde, u sim a ɛwà lumwɛy, u ntsü a Bɛtesayidà, umpal nde ŋakwo usàpay nde un'sɛŋ a baar. <verse eid="MRK 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46"/>Ungö mupay ba, nde kàbeenà u mɔŋ mukàyamà. <verse eid="MRK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47"/>Làsisye, bwaar làkäl lan'tol uboboo a ɛwà, nde kàsàkal nde mpɛl u mɛɛn. <verse eid="MRK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48"/>Muman naa alɔŋki ande bàmunwan a ngwal muluk nkay ntɔn un'pöb kàyee lisà, tsütsü a taaŋtyà, nde kan'yà mper akà ba wàmuyikyà udu a ɛwà, waa kàlasoonà. <verse eid="MRK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49"/>Mpal bun'mɛn ba wàmuyikyà udu a ɛwà, ba bàsi naa bwo kàkäl, waa bàsi in'kwɛŋ. <verse eid="MRK 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50"/>Ntɔn ba banswà bàkyer un'man, lingyoomà waa lawɛl. Wɛɛ apan, nde kàyäm anà ba, waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Làwɛl ibaal! Wà mɛ, twon lan'man bɔɔmà! » <verse eid="MRK 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51"/>Apan, nde kàbilà u bwaar apà ba, un'pöb waa kànye. Uboo a ba ŋakwo, ba bàbemà mbɔɔn. <verse eid="MRK 6:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52"/>Kutɛn aŋàbwaŋ, ba bàsàyöb anki mbuul a impà a mampà, ntɔn mpem aba yàkäl bwoor.<verse eid="MRK 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'kɔɔr abɛy u Ngɛnɛsàlɛr</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Màt 14.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53"/>Ungö a nsaabà, ba bàtɔlà u mɛɛn a Ngɛnɛsàlɛr, waa bàbäm bwaar aba. <verse eid="MRK 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54"/>Pa bàtoo ba u bwaar, baar waa bàyöb Yɛsu, <verse eid="MRK 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55"/>waa bàkyen ntiin kà itiir a nsi akin kyanswà, waa bàsɛmà mukun'twääl aŋukyal udu a ipɔy kà ikal kyanswà bàweemà ba naa Yɛsu wà kwo. <verse eid="MRK 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56"/>Ntsü yanswà kàbilà nde: uboo an'bul itàkal an'bul a kölàköl, itàkal kà itsuŋ a ndwà, baar bàtɔ̈ɔ̈là aŋukyal u làbay, waa bun'bɔ̈ɔ̈nà naa nde kawɛy ba bàbä itàkal làpan a ipfɛy ande mpɛl. Abun baar abà bàtɛɛ kya mpi bàkyer akɔɔrà.<verse eid="MRK 6:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7"/>
  <para style="s1">In'kɔɔn a andweer</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Màt 15.1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1"/>Amfarisi anà alɔɔŋ a un'kɔɔn amwɛy bàfü Yɛlusàlɛm ban'köŋ apà Yɛsu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2"/>Ba ban'man naa alɔŋki ande amwɛy bàmudyà anà an'kɔɔ a ŋingyäy, iswaŋà naa ukɔɔn aywɛy ma. <verse eid="MRK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3"/>Ntɔn Amfarisi, itàkal Ayudà banswà, bàfàdyà anki ukɔɔn aywɛy an'kɔɔ ubwaŋàbwaŋ, mulab nkääl a andweer. <verse eid="MRK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4"/>Ba bàsàfà mukàlyaaŋ, ba bàfàdyà anki kusà mutàpöŋ. Ye anà nsyääl asin mbɔɔn yindweer bàfàlab ba: mpööŋ a an'kɔɔb, yà an'buuŋ anà yan'lɔŋà.<verse eid="MRK 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5"/>Amfarisi anà alɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn ban'fuul Yɛsu naa: « Ntɔn nkye alɔŋki angye mpa bàfàlab ba in'kɔɔn a andweer, wɛɛ ba bàfàdyà anà an'kɔɔ a ŋingyäy? » <verse eid="MRK 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6"/>Nde waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Yɛsay kàtɛ ngɔɔm aŋàbwaŋ ntɔn bɛ baar a mpem yweel, ntɔn bàsön naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">"Un'sɛŋ wà mɛ làkoo afan'sà udu a ndem mpɛl, wɛɛ mpem aba yukwɛl anà mɛ."<verse eid="MRK 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7"/>Ngyamàkà bàfan'sà ba yà bunàbun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">ntɔn nsyääl bàfàlɔŋ ba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">yan'kyän a baar."<verse eid="MRK 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8"/>Bɛ nswɛɛŋ a Nzam làfàsà ukɔl, wɛɛ bɛ làfàndäär anà nsyääl a baar. »<verse eid="MRK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9"/>Nde kàfàtɛn a ba naa: « Bɛ làfàtɔn ubwaŋàbwaŋ nswɛɛŋ a Nzam ntɔn mukaar nkääl abɛ! <verse eid="MRK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10"/>Ntɔn Mɔsɛ kàtɛn naa: "Sà làkoo akà taaràŋà anà ngwa", sye naa: "Wɛy mbuur ato taarànde anà ngwän, ukyen ukwà." <verse eid="MRK 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11"/>Wɛɛ bɛ, bɛ làfàtɛn naa: mbuur usàtɛn a taarànde itàkal a ngwän naa: "Undiir alàwal ngye akà mɛ wà Kɔrban", ikaswaŋà naa "kab in'kyɛɛl", <verse eid="MRK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12"/>bɛ làmun'pà mbwo naa nde ukɔɔn akyer akundiir mwɛy ntɔn taarànde itàkal ntɔn ngwän." <verse eid="MRK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13"/>Lalan, bɛ làfàdwa Ndaa a Nzam ntɔn nkääl a andweer abɛ làfàlɔŋ bɛ. Bɛ làfàkyer sye indiir asin mbɔɔn byà ifà aki. »<verse eid="MRK 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Indiir ifàbuul mbuur ŋingyäy</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Màt 15.10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14"/>Ungö apan, Yɛsu kàfàbel un'sɛŋ a baar, waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Lan'wem bɛ banswà, làyöb naa: <verse eid="MRK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15"/>Akundiir mwɛy tɛy afàfà nsà awafàbilà uboo a mbuur afun'buul wàŋingyäy. Wɛɛ indiir ifàtoo u mbuur ifun'buul wàŋingyäy. » <verse eid="MRK 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16"/>[ Kya mbuur mwɛy usàkal anà an'tsü awem, wɛy nde uwem! ]<verse eid="MRK 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17"/>Umpal kàbilà Yɛsu u ndwà, ukwɛl a un'sɛŋ a baar, alɔŋki ande bun'fuulà ntɔn itim aki. <verse eid="MRK 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18"/>Nde kàtɛn a ba naa: « Nkye anà bɛ sye, abun bɛ un'yɛnà watɛy? Nkye bɛ làyöb anki naa undiir mwɛy tɛy afafà nsà anà afàbilà uboo a mbuur ukwe anki mukun'buul wàŋingyäy, <verse eid="MRK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19"/>ntɔn wa ufàbilà anki u mpem ande, wɛɛ kan'bäl ande, ungö wa akyà u nkuràndwà? » Abun nde kàkyäänà naa isaa byanswà byàŋàpɔŋà. <verse eid="MRK 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20"/>Nde waa kàtɛn naa: « Ndaa ifafà uboo a mbuur, ya ifun'buul wàŋingyäy. <verse eid="MRK 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21"/>Ntɔn an'kyän an'be ifàtoo fà boo, fà mpem a baar: ipasàsɛ, küb, ndwääl a baar, <verse eid="MRK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22"/>intswem, ngyal a in'naaŋ, an'kyän an'be, loor, mɔ̈ɔ̈ a isak isak, intwɛn, mbɛɛy, nsɛɛn a an'pɛy, unsil. <verse eid="MRK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23"/>Indiir ibe abi byanswà byàfàtoo uboo, waa byàfàbuul mbuur wàŋingyäy. »<verse eid="MRK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Làkwikilà a un'kaar ungyey</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Màt 15.21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24"/>Yɛsu kàlwomà nde apan, nde kàkyen itiir a Tir. Nde kàbilà u ndwà mwɛy, nde kàkwen anki naa akà mbuur mwɛy uyɔ̈b. Wɛɛ yàkwe anki naa nde ukäl aŋàyee. <verse eid="MRK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25"/>Yàmɛnà naa un'kaar mwɛy, mwan ande wun'kaar kàkäl anà dweelà a làbe. Pa kàwem nde làsaŋ a Yɛsu, laa kàyi nde, waa kàbü kà in'kɔl ande. <verse eid="MRK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26"/>Un'kaar awà kàkäl ungɛlɛki, un'nsi Fɛnisi u Siri. Nde kàlɔ̈ɔ̈mà akà Yɛsu naa nde uböŋ unsɔŋà unsà mwan ande wun'kaar. <verse eid="MRK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27"/>Yɛsu kàtɛɛnà a nde naa: « Wɛy baan bàtàyuur, kàyubwaŋ anki muwal isaa a baan ntɔn mutɔɔm bya akà bimbwà. » <verse eid="MRK 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28"/>Nde wà kun'fuur naa: « Ndandaa, Mwol, itàkal bimbwà, ungyɛl a mɛsà, byàfàdyà mfür a isaa a baan. » <verse eid="MRK 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29"/>Apan Yɛsu kàtɛn a nde naa: « Ntɔn ndaa ayi, kyen: unsɔŋà kan'too u mwan angye wun'kaar. » <verse eid="MRK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30"/>Nde kàfura ndwà ande, waa kàmɛn mwan ande wàŋàsilà udu a itäb: unsɔŋà akyàtoo amu nde.<verse eid="MRK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'kɔɔr nkiin ikwan'tsü</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31"/>Yɛsu kàlwomà nde itiir a Tir, nde kàfurà ntsü a ɛwà a Ngalilɛ u mbwo a Sidɔn, waa kàlyaŋ itiir a Dɛkapɔl. <verse eid="MRK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32"/>Baar bun'twääl nkiin mwɛy kàyäämà a mpay, ba bun'bɔ̈ɔ̈n naa nde kun'si kɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33"/>Apan, Yɛsu kun'syen ukɔl, ukwel a un'sɛŋ a baar, kun'biil mpin kan'tsü, kàtsül an'te, waa kun'bä u làlem. <verse eid="MRK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34"/>Ungö nde kàsɛn mii u du, kànyääm ikye, waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Efàfàta! » Ikaswaŋà naa: « Dubà! » <verse eid="MRK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35"/>Kà imbürà, an'tsü ande waa màdubà, làlem ande waa làtsuŋà, waa kàyäämà ubwaŋàbwaŋ. <verse eid="MRK 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36"/>Yɛsu kaswɛŋ naa ba bàkɔɔn asam akà mbuur mwɛy. Wɛɛ kàsin aswaŋà nde, ba bàsin apayà làsaŋ. <verse eid="MRK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37"/>Ba bàkäl mubem mbɔɔn, waa bàtɛɛnà naa: « Indiir byanswà nde kan'kyer ubwaŋ! Nde wàmukyer naa ikwan'tsü bàwem, nkiin bàsi ndaa! »<verse eid="MRK 7:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'dii baar nsaab nà</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Màt 15.32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1"/>Kà ilä abin un'sɛŋ a baar mbɔɔn kàkyer afàköŋ. Wa kàkäl anki anà indiir adyà, Yɛsu kàbel alɔŋki ande, waa kàtɛn a ba naa: <verse eid="MRK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2"/>« Mɛ aman ngyɛb mbɔɔn ntɔn un'sɛŋ a baar wà, ntɔn, le, ŋàbà ilä itär abà ba anà mɛ, wɛɛ ba undiir adyà watɛy. <verse eid="MRK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3"/>Wɛɛ, kya mɛ in'safuur an'bul aba anà ngyal, ba bakyer akàyɔn u mbwo. Bàmbɔɔn uboo aba bàfü kwɛl. » <verse eid="MRK 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4"/>Alɔŋki ande bun'fuur naa: « U nsi ipɔl ayi, ntsü nà ban'kwo bi muman undiir adii ba, waa ba bàyuur? » <verse eid="MRK 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5"/>Nde kafuul naa: « Bɛ làwe amà mampà an'kwe? » Ba bàtɛn naa: « Nsambwaar ». <verse eid="MRK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6"/>Apan nde kàswɛŋ un'sɛŋ a baar mubwaay u mɛɛn. Ungɔ̈ apan nde kàwɛl mampà nsambwaar, kàfuur an'tɔɔn, kàtsül ma, waa kàpɛ ma akalɔŋki ntɔn ba bàkäb. Ba bàkäb ma akun'sɛŋ a baar wanswà. <verse eid="MRK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7"/>Ba bàkäl sye anà binsö imwɛy. Ungɔ̈ musaak bya, nde kàtɛn naa ba bàkäb bya sye. <verse eid="MRK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8"/>Baar waa bàdi, waa bàyüür. Ba bàsyen in'lwaŋ, in'lwaŋ nsambwaar myà itsü byàsäl. <verse eid="MRK 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9"/>Kyekà baar bàkäl isii a nsaab nà. Ungö apan nde wakapay, <verse eid="MRK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10"/>apan sye nde kàbilà u bwaar anà alɔŋki ande, waa bàkyen itiir a Dalmanutà.<verse eid="MRK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Amfarisi ban'lɔm idiim a impà kyan'fà du</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Màt 16.1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11"/>Amfarisi bàyi ba, waa bàsɛmà musà mbaaŋ anà Yɛsu ntɔn mukun'lwab ndaa. Ba bun'lɔ̈ɔ̈m impà kyan'fà du. <verse eid="MRK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12"/>Nde kàŋyäm mbɔɔn unsà an'kyän ande, waa kàtɛn naa: « Ntɔn nkye baar a nkööl ayi bàlɔɔmà ba impà? Ndandaa mɛ alàkyään, baar a nkööl ayi akidiim a impà mwɛy bàsapà anki. » <verse eid="MRK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13"/>Ungö apan kàsawɛy nde, nde kàfàbilà u bwaar, waa kàkyen sim a ɛwà lumwɛy.<verse eid="MRK 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ful a Amfarisi anà là Ɛlɔdi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Màt 16.5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14"/>Alɔŋki bàkyärà mpiim muwal mampà, waa bàkäl alà làmwɛy mpel u bwaar. <verse eid="MRK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15"/>Yɛsu kaswɛŋ naa: « Le, làkäl kigyɛɛŋ ntɔn ful a Amfarisi anà là Ɛlɔdi. » <verse eid="MRK 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16"/>Ba bàsyeelà mbaaŋ ba a ba ntɔn ba bàkäl anki anà mampà. <verse eid="MRK 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17"/>Yɛsu kàmɛn nde abun, waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Ntɔn nkye làsyeelà bɛ mbaaŋ ntɔn lan'kɔɔn bɛ mampà? Nkye bɛ ŋàtàwal anki un'yɛnà, waa bɛ mpa làyöbà? Nkye mpem abɛ yàŋàbwà bwoor? <verse eid="MRK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18"/>Bɛ làwe anà mii, nkye bɛ làkamanà anki? Bɛ làwe anà an'tsü, nkye bɛ làkawɛɛmà anki? Nkye bɛ làfàkayöbà anki: <verse eid="MRK 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19"/>mpal kàtsül mɛ mampà an'tyeen ntɔn abaal nsaab tyeen, in'lwaŋ aŋàyɔl a itsü in'kwe bɛ làsyen? » Ba bàtɛn a nde naa: « Kwɛm aŋiyweel. » <verse eid="MRK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20"/>« Wɛɛ mpal kàtsül mɛ mampà nsambwaar ntɔn abaal nsaab nà, in'lwaŋ in'kwe myàŋàyɔl a itsü bɛ làsyen? » Ba waa bàtɛn naa: « Nsambwaar. » <verse eid="MRK 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21"/>Nde waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Nkye bɛ ŋàtàyöb anki? » <verse eid="MRK 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22"/>Ba ban'tol Bɛtesayidà. Waa bun'twääl ikwàmii mwɛy, bun'bɔ̈ɔ̈n naa nde kun'bä. <verse eid="MRK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23"/>Nde kàtɛ ikwàmii mpi u kɔɔ, waa kun'twey u nsà a bul. Nde kun'fül an'te u mii, kun'si an'kɔɔ, waa kun'fuulà naa: « Nkye ngye akimanà undiir? » <verse eid="MRK 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24"/>Nde kun'duub mii, waa kàtɛɛnà naa: « Mɛ in'täälà baar, mɛ ba amanà asànaa in'te, wɛɛ ba bàmuyikyà. » <verse eid="MRK 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25"/>Apan Yɛsu kàfun'sà an'kɔɔ udu a mii. Baal awà waa kàmɛn ubwaŋàbwaŋ. Nde kàkyer akɔrà, waa kamɛnà indiir byanswà umwɛy umwɛy. <verse eid="MRK 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26"/>Lalan Yɛsu kun'fuur nde ndwà ande, waa kun'kyään naa: « Twon an'bilà akikikye uboo a bul. »<verse eid="MRK 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petɔlà kan'tɛn naa Yɛsu wà Klistɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Màt 16.13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9.18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27"/>Yɛsu kàkyen anà alɔŋki ande u ntsü an'bul a tsütsü anà Sɛzarɛ a Filipo. U mbwo, nde kàfuul alɔŋki ande naa: « Baar bàfàtɛn naa mɛ in'wà nà? » <verse eid="MRK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28"/>Ba waa bun'fuur naa: « Ywan Un'düümà, bumwɛy, Ɛli, bumwɛy naa umwɛy uboo a aŋangɔɔm. » <verse eid="MRK 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29"/>Nde waa ufàfuul: « Wɛɛ bɛ ŋakwo làtɛn naa mɛ in'wà nà? » Petɔlà waa ufuur: « Ngye awà Klistɔ. » <verse eid="MRK 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30"/>Yɛsu kaswɛŋ a ngwal naa ba bàkɔɔn ayäm akà mbuur mwɛy ntɔn nde.<verse eid="MRK 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'kyään nkweel anà ngwiiyà ande</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-23">Màt 16.21-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22">Luk 9.22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31"/>Apan, nde kàsɛmà mukalɔŋ naa: « Mwan a mbuur akyer aman mpay mbɔɔn. Andwer, amfum a angaŋ anà alɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn bàkyer un'tɔn, bàkyer un'dwa, waa ungö ilä itär nde akyer awiyà. » <verse eid="MRK 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32"/>Ndaa ayi nde kàtɛɛnà kimii imii. Apan Petɔlà kun'naan ukɔl, waa kàsɛmà mukun'ŋän. <verse eid="MRK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33"/>Wɛɛ nde waa kàbulà, kàler alɔŋki ande, kàŋän Petɔlà, waa kàtɛn naa: « Satanà, kyen ungö a mɛ! Ntɔn ngye akayweerà anki indiir a Nzam, wɛɛ indiir a baar. »<verse eid="MRK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34"/>Ungö nde kàbel un'sɛŋ a baar anà alɔŋki ande, waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Isàkal naa mbuur akwen mukan'lab, wɛy nde ukɔɔb ndür ande, usɛɛn kulunsi ande, waa kan'lab. <verse eid="MRK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35"/>Ntɔn mbuur usàkwen mutii mɔ̈ɔ̈ ande, wa asàkyà bwà, wɛɛ mbuur usàpiy mɔ̈ɔ̈ ande ntɔn mɛ anà làsaŋ aŋàbwaŋ, nde asàtswà wa. <verse eid="MRK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36"/>Bweel nà mbuur kan'kwo muwal uman naa nde kan'wal mɛɛn manswà, wɛɛ mɔ̈ɔ̈ ande ukyà bwà? <verse eid="MRK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37"/>Abun, ininà mbuur kan'kwo mupà ntɔn musɔɔm mɔ̈ɔ̈ ande? <verse eid="MRK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38"/>Ntɔn mbuur usàwem mɛ nswɛn anà ndaa amɛ uboo a nkööl ayi yinswem anà yube, Mwan a mbuur sye asun'wem nswɛn mpal usàyà nde unsà làkoo a Taarànde, anà akyeey in'kyɛɛl. »<verse eid="MRK 8:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1"/>Yɛsu kàfàtɛn a ba naa: « Ndandaa mɛ alàkyään, amwɛy uboo a baar bà pà, bàsàkwà anki kusà muman Imwol a Nzam kyàmuyiyà anà ngwal. »<verse eid="MRK 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngyoolà a Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-9">Màt 17.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9.28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2"/>Ungö ilä isyaam, Yɛsu kàwɛl Petɔlà, Zyak anà Ywan, waa kasyen u mpey udu a mɔŋ a bwɛlàbwɛl. Nde kàyoolà ifà u mii a ba, <verse eid="MRK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3"/>ipfɛy ande byàbulà byà tsɛk tsɛk, anà pɛɛl làmwɛy mpa kan'kwo akà un'yiir mwɛy mutwey. <verse eid="MRK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4"/>Ɛli kàyàmɛnà anà Mɔsɛ akà ba. Ba bàkayäämà a Yɛsu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5"/>Petɔlà kàtɛn a Yɛsu naa: « Un'lɔɔŋ, yubwaŋ naa bi ikäl apà. Wɛy bi imbaar ntɛn, ntɛn tär: mwɛy ntɔn ngye, mwɛy ntɔn Mɔsɛ, mwɛy ntɔn Ɛli. » <verse eid="MRK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6"/>Nde kàyöb anki naa nde nkye utɛɛnà, ntɔn matɛɛr màkyer awal. <verse eid="MRK 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7"/>Un'böŋ mwey kàyafwee wa, ndaa mwɛy yàtoo uboo un'böŋ awà naa: « Awà wà Mwan amɛ wà nkween. Lun'wem! » <verse eid="MRK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8"/>Ungö apan, bàler ba umbil aba, ba bàsàman anki akà mbuur mwɛy, Yɛsu mpɛl anà ba. <verse eid="MRK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9"/>Umpal bàyàtyà ba u mɔŋ, nde katsüŋ mukyään itàkal akà mbuur mwɛy ndaa bàmɛn ba, tii mpal usàwiyà Mwan a mbuur uboo a akü. <verse eid="MRK 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10"/>Ba bàkyer akaar nswɛɛŋ ayi, wɛɛ ba bàfuulà ba a ba naa: « Ikaswaŋà aben "ngwiiyà uboo a akü"? »<verse eid="MRK 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11"/>Apan ba bun'fuul naa: « Ntɔn nkye alɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn bàfàtɛn ba naa: "Ɛli akyer atwab atàyà"? » <verse eid="MRK 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12"/>Nde kàtɛn a ba naa: « Yabwɛy naa Ɛli atàyà muyàfuur indiir byanswà u mbwo. Wɛɛ ntɔn nkye bàsön ba ntɔn Mwan a mbuur naa nde akyɛr aman mpay mbɔɔn, bun'wal asànaa undiir a bunàbun? <verse eid="MRK 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13"/>Wɛɛ mɛ alàkyään naa Ɛli kàkyàyà, baar bun'kyer ndaa yanswà bàkwen ba, asànaa bàsön ya ntɔn nde. »<verse eid="MRK 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'kɔɔr mwan kàkäl anà dweelà a làbe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Màt 17.14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luk 9.37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14"/>Mpal bàyafurà ba akà alɔŋki, ba bàmɛn un'sɛŋ a baar mbɔɔn apà ba anà alɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn bàmusyeelà mbaaŋ anà ba. <verse eid="MRK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15"/>Pa kàmɛn wa Yɛsu, un'sɛŋ a baar wanswà laa kàbamà wa, waa kàkyeenà ntiin mukun'pà mbɔr. <verse eid="MRK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16"/>Nde waa kafuul naa: « Ininà bɛ làsyeelà mbaaŋ anà ba? » <verse eid="MRK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17"/>Baal mwɛy uboo a un'sɛŋ a baar kun'fuur naa: « Un'lɔɔŋ, mɛ amatwääl mwan amɛ wàbaal: nde we anà dweelà a nkiin. <verse eid="MRK 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18"/>Ikal kyanswà lun'kaar la, la lun'bwiy u mɛɛn, mwan ugyɔrà an'te, laa ukwoor nde an'din ande, waa ubwà un'sey. Mɛ an'tɛn a alɔŋki angye naa ba bàböŋ la, wɛɛ ba bàsàkal anki anà ngwal. » <verse eid="MRK 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19"/>Nde waa utɛn a ba naa: « Nkööl ikɔ̈ɔ̈n làkwikilà, tii nkye taaŋ mɛ insàkal anà bɛ? Tii mpal nà mɛ in'sàkaŋ mpem ntɔn bɛ? Lan'twääl awà. » <verse eid="MRK 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20"/>Ba waa bun'twääl. Umpal làmɛn dweelà a làbe Yɛsu, la làni mwan a ngwal, mwan kàbü u mɛɛn, waa kàyisilà wàmuyigyɔrà an'te. <verse eid="MRK 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21"/>Yɛsu kàfuul taarànde naa: « Sɛmà taaŋ nà ya ifun'yeel? » Nde waa kàten naa: « Sɛmà imbɛy ande. <verse eid="MRK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22"/>Mbalà mbɔɔn la làfun'tɔɔm u mbaa anà kan'dà ntɔn mukun'dwa. Wɛɛ, isàkal naa ngye an'kwo mukyer undiir, yà ibay, ntɔn ngyɛb angye akà bi! » <verse eid="MRK 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23"/>Yɛsu waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Isàkal naa ngye an'kwo! ... Indiir byanswà byàŋàkwo akà mbuur awe anà làkwikilà. » <verse eid="MRK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24"/>Apan sye, taar a mwan kàsi un'kwɛŋ naa: « Mɛ an'sà làkwikilà! Mbay ntɔn an'kɔɔn mɛ làkwikilà! »<verse eid="MRK 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25"/>Yɛsu, abà kàmɛn nde un'sɛŋ a baar wàmuyàkɔ̈ŋ, nde kàswɛŋ dweelà a làbe, waa kàtɛn naa: « Dweelà a nkiin anà ikwan'tsü, mɛ amaswaŋ, too ubɔɔ a mwan wà, twon an'fyefurà! » <verse eid="MRK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26"/>Dweelà làsi in'kwɛŋ, waa lun'ni a ngwal. Mwan kàbulà asànaa wàŋàkwà, lalan bàmbɔɔn bàteenà ba naa: « Nde kan'kwà. » <verse eid="MRK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27"/>Wɛɛ Yɛsu kun'tɛ mpi u kɔɔ, kun'mbaar, nde waa kàmbarà. <verse eid="MRK 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28"/>Mpal kàfurà Yɛsu ndwà, alɔŋki ande bun'fuul ukɔl naa: « Wɛɛ bi, ntɔn nkye mpa ikwe bi muböŋ dweelà a làbe alanà? » <verse eid="MRK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29"/>Nde kàtɛn a ba naa: « Dweelà a tub alà làfàtoo u ngyamàkà mpɛl. »<verse eid="MRK 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'fàkyään nkweel anà ngwiiyà ande.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Màt 17.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luk 9.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30"/>Ba bàlwomà apan, waa bàsoonà Ngalilɛ. Yɛsu kàkwen anki naa baar bàyɔ̈b. <verse eid="MRK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31"/>Ntɔn nde kàlɔɔŋà alɔŋki ande, waa kàtɛɛnà a ba naa: « Mwan a mbuur bàkyer ayun'yälà kàn'kɔɔ a baar, ba bàkyer ayun'dwà, waa ilä itär ungö a ndwääl ande, nde akyer ayàwiyà. » <verse eid="MRK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32"/>Ba bàyöbà anki ndaa ayin, wɛɛ ba bàweemà bɔɔmà mukun'fuul.<verse eid="MRK 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nà awà mbuur a kɔ̈làkɔ̈l?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Màt 18.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9.46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33"/>Ba bàkyen Kapɛrnawum. Umpal kàkäl nde u ndwà, Yɛsu kàfuul alɔŋki ande naa: « Ininà bɛ làyisyeelà mbaaŋ u mbwo? » <verse eid="MRK 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34"/>Wɛɛ ba bàkäl akul, ntɔn u mbwo, ba bàyisyeelà mbaaŋ ba a ba ntɔn muyöb naa nà awà mbuur a kölàköl. <verse eid="MRK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35"/>Yɛsu kàkyer abwaay, waa kàbel Bàkwen Aŋiyweel, waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Isàkal naa mbuur akwen mukäl wàtàtwɛb, wɛy nde ukäl wàngöngö anà un'syääl a baar banswà. » <verse eid="MRK 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36"/>Apan nde kàwɛl mwan mwɛy, waa kun'si uboboo a ba. Ungö akun'böbà mpi, nde kàtɛn a ba naa: <verse eid="MRK 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37"/>« Mbuur awal mwan asànaa wà kikɔb amɛ, nde kan'wal mɛ ŋakwo: mbuur kàman'wal, kà mɛ anki nde kan'wal, wɛ Mbuur kan'töm. »<verse eid="MRK 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuur mpa afàkyer bi ube wà anà bi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luk 9.49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38"/>Ywan waa kàtɛn a Yɛsu naa: « Un'lɔɔŋ, bi kàmɛn mbuur mwɛy wàmuböŋ an'dweelà an'be kikɔb angye, wɛɛ bi kàleŋ mukun'tsuŋ mukyer abun ntɔn nde bi kàfilabà anki. » <verse eid="MRK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39"/>Wɛɛ Yɛsu kàtɛn naa: « Twon làmutsuŋ, ntɔn kà we anà mbuur anki kan'kwo mukyer impà kà ikɔb amɛ, waa ungö apan nde ufàtɛn ube ntɔn mɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40"/>Abun, mbuur mpa afàtɔn bi wà anà bi. <verse eid="MRK 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41"/>Mbuur wanswà asàlapà kɔɔb a an'dà anwà, ntɔn bɛ làbà baar a Klistɔ, mɛ alàkyään ndandaa, bweel ande làsàkyà anki bwà.<verse eid="MRK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Igyɛɛŋ a ngwal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-11">Màt 18.6-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk 17.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42"/>« Wɛɛ mbuur wanswà asiinà umwɛy uboo a bibaan ban'sà làkwikilà bà akà mɛ mubwà unsà ube, yan'söön ubwaŋ akà nde naa bun'bäm nkà a kölàköl u bway, waa bun'tɔɔm kà ɛwà. <verse eid="MRK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43"/>Isàkal naa kɔɔ angye làfasyen nkuur unsà ube, tsul la. Ntɔn yan'söön ubwaŋ naa ngye abilà u mɔ̈ɔ̈ kɔɔ làmwɛy, akwànaa ngye mukal amà an'kɔɔ an'mɔ̈ɔ̈l, waa akyà yaaŋ a mbaa mpa làfàdim. [ <verse eid="MRK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44"/>Kwo, "in'swab myàfàkwà anki, mbaa ifàdim anki akà ikikye." ] <verse eid="MRK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45"/>Isàkal naa làkɔl angye làfasyen nkuur unsà ube, tsul la. Ntɔn yan'söön ubwaŋ naa ngye abilà u mɔ̈ɔ̈ anà too, akwànaa ngye mukal amyà in'kɔl myeel, waa akyà yaaŋ a mbaa. [ <verse eid="MRK 9:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46"/>Kwo, "in'swab myàfàkwà anki, mbaa ifàdim anki akà ikikye." ] <verse eid="MRK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47"/>Isàkal naa dii angye làfasyen nkuur unsà ube, kwol la. Ntɔn yan'söön ubwaŋ naa ngye abilà imwol a Nzam anà dii làmwɛy, akwànaa ngye mukal amyà mii myeel, waa batɔɔm u yaaŋ a mbaa.<verse eid="MRK 9:47"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48"/>Kwo, in'swab myàfàkwà anki, mbaa ifàdim anki akà ikikye.<verse eid="MRK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49"/>« Abun, mbuur wanswà asàlyaŋ u mbaa, asàwal muŋ ntɔn mupɔŋà.<verse eid="MRK 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50"/>« Muŋ wà undiir aŋàbwaŋ, wɛɛ ntsà awa isàwà, bɛ ya làfuur aben? Làkäl anà muŋ uboo abɛ ŋakwo, làkäl unsà duu uboo amwɛy anà bumwɛy. »<verse eid="MRK 9:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu anà ndwääl a bɔr</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Màt 19.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16.18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1"/>Yɛsu kàlwomà nde apan, nde kàkyen itiir a nsi a Yuday, u sim a Yɔrdan lumwɛy. In'sɛŋ a baar myàfàköŋ apà nde, nde kàfalɔɔŋà asànaa nkääl ande. <verse eid="MRK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2"/>Amfarisi bàsin tsütsü apà nde ntɔn mukun'fuul naa : « Nkye mbwo yàmwo baal muböŋ un'kyay ande. » <verse eid="MRK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3"/>Yɛsu kafuur naa: « Ininà Mɔsɛ kàlaswɛŋ? » <verse eid="MRK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4"/>Ba bàtɛn naa: « Mɔsɛ kàpɛ mbwo musɔn ukaan a nkaabà anà muböŋ un'kaar. » <verse eid="MRK 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5"/>Yɛsu waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Yà ntɔn bwoor a mpem abɛ waa nde kàlapɛ nswɛɛŋ ayi. <verse eid="MRK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6"/>Wɛɛ u nsɛmà a nkyeer, Nzam "kakyer baal anà un'kaar". <verse eid="MRK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7"/>"Lalan baal asàwɛy taarànde anà ngwän, waa usàbääb a un'kyay ande, <verse eid="MRK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8"/>waa ba bàbɔ̈ɔ̈l bàsabulà ndür mwɛy. Apan, ba bàfàkal anki abɔ̈ɔ̈l, wɛɛ ndür mwɛy. <verse eid="MRK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9"/>Abun, wɛy mbuur ukɔɔn akaab ayi kàtüüb Nzam." » <verse eid="MRK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10"/>Mpal bàkäl ba u ndwà, alɔŋki bàfun'fuul ntɔn ndaa ayi. <verse eid="MRK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11"/>Nde kàtɛn a ba naa: « Baal usàwɛy un'kyay ande, usàbääl un'kyay asin, nde kan'tà inswem akà wàtàtwɛb. <verse eid="MRK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12"/>Isàkal naa un'kaar kan'wɛy un'dim ande, usàwal wàsin, nde wà un'kaar inswem. »<verse eid="MRK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu anà baan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Màt 19.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18.15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13"/>Baar bàtwäälà baan ntɔn nde kabä, wɛɛ alɔŋki bàŋän ba. <verse eid="MRK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14"/>Mpal kàmɛn nde abun, Yɛsu kàmɛn ube, waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Làwɛy baan bàyi akà mɛ! Twon làmatsuŋ, ntɔn Imwol a Nzam kye a baar abà asànaa ba. <verse eid="MRK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15"/>Ndandaa mɛ alàkyään, mbuur mpà awal Imwol a Nzam asànaa mwan, nde kya usàbilà anki. » <verse eid="MRK 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16"/>Ungö, nde kàbööbà baan, waa kasi an'kɔɔ ntɔn mukasaak.<verse eid="MRK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ŋun'naaŋ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Màt 19.16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18.18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17"/>Mpal kàkäl Yɛsu mukyà, mbuur mwɛy kàyi u ntiin, waa kàbü an'köm kusà ande, waa kun'fuul naa: « Un'lɔɔŋ aŋàbwaŋ, mɛ in'kyer aben muwal bweel a mɔ̈ɔ̈ a mbul a in'tye? » <verse eid="MRK 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18"/>Yɛsu kàtɛn a nde naa: « Ntɔn nkye aman'bel ngye aŋàbwaŋ? Akà mbuur mwɛy wàŋàbwaŋ watɛy isàkal naa kà Nzam mpɛl anki. <verse eid="MRK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19"/>Ngye akiyöb in'kɔɔn: "Twon an'dwà, twon an'tà inswem, twon an'yib, twon an'tà imbäl a loor, twon an'kyer mbuur ube, sà làkoo akà taaràŋà anà ngwa." » <verse eid="MRK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20"/>Mbuur waa kun'fuur naa: « Un'lɔɔŋ, ayin yanswà mɛ in'kyer afàlab sɛmà imbɛy amɛ. » <verse eid="MRK 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21"/>Yɛsu kun'ler nde, waa kun'kwen, waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Undiir mwɛy mpɛl kàmakɔ̈ɔ̈n: kyen, yälà indiir angye byanswà, pà ngim ya akà aŋàlàmbwà, waa ngye asàwal un'naaŋ u du. Ungö apan, yan'läb. » <verse eid="MRK 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22"/>Wɛɛ u ndaa ayi, nde kàbü mpye, waa kàkyen u ngyɛb mbɔɔn. Ntɔn nde kàkäl anà indiir mbɔɔn.<verse eid="MRK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23"/>Yɛsu kàler umbil ande, waa kàtɛn a alɔŋki ande naa: « Yà mpay mbɔɔn akà aŋin'naaŋ mubilà kà Imwol a Nzam! » <verse eid="MRK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24"/>Alɔŋki bàmɛn mpay ntɔn ndaa ande. Wɛɛ Yɛsu kàfàtɛn a ba naa: « Baan amɛ, yà mpay mbɔɔn mubilà kà Imwol a Nzam! <verse eid="MRK 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25"/>Mpay yatɛy mbɔɔn akà mpoonà mubilà u mun a nsway akwànaa ŋun'naaŋ mubilà kà Imwol a Nzam. » <verse eid="MRK 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26"/>Ba bakyer abem mbɔɔn, waa bàtɛɛnà ba a ba naa: « Abun, nà kan'kwo muwà mɔ̈ɔ̈? » <verse eid="MRK 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27"/>Yɛsu kaler, waa kàtɛn naa: « Ya ikwe anki akà baar, wɛɛ akà Nzam yanswà ikyer afàkwo. » <verse eid="MRK 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28"/>Petɔlà kàsɛmà mutɛn a nde naa: « Le bi, bi kàkyàwɛy indiir byanswà ntɔn mulab ngye. » <verse eid="MRK 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29"/>Yɛsu waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Ndandaa mɛ alàkyään, isàkal naa mbuur an'sàwɛy ndwà, atɔŋ abaal, atɔŋ akaar, ngwän, taarànde, baan, an'ywaŋ ntɔn mɛ anà ntɔn Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ, <verse eid="MRK 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30"/>nde asàwal mbalà nkam aŋàsöönà u paŋà alà, ndwà, atɔŋ abaal, atɔŋ akaar, ngwän, baan, an'ywaŋ, - anà nkwaaŋ - anà u paŋà làyà, mɔ̈ɔ̈ a mbul a in'tye. <verse eid="MRK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31"/>Lalan, bàtàtwɛb mbɔɔn bàsàkal bàngöngö, bàngöngö bàsàkal bàtàtwɛb. »<verse eid="MRK 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'kyään nkweel anà ngwiiyà ande mbalà yàtär</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Màt 20.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32"/>Ba bàkäl u mbwo mubeenà Yɛlusàlɛm. Yɛsu kàyikyeenà kusà a ba. Ba bàkäl mutɛɛr, baar bàyun'labà bàkal u bɔɔmà. Apan nde kàfàwal Bàkwem Aŋiyweel anà nde, waa kàsɛmà mukakyään ndaa ayà ikun'bweel: <verse eid="MRK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33"/>« Le, bi iwàmubeenà Yɛlusàlɛm, akun Mwan a mbuur bàkyer akun'yälà akà amfum angaŋ anà akà alɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn. Ba bàkun'tsüül mbar a ukwà, waa bàkun'yälà kan'kɔɔ a baar mpa abà Ayudà, <verse eid="MRK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34"/>bàkyer akun'sɛ, bàkyer akun'tsul an'te, bàkyer akun'kam an'füm anà bàkyer akun'dwa, wɛɛ ungö a ilä itär, nde akyer asàwiyà. »<verse eid="MRK 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndɔ̈ɔ̈m a Zyak anà Ywan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Màt 20.20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35"/>Apan, Zyak anà Ywan, baan a Zebeday, bàkyen tsütsü apà Yɛsu, waa bàtɛn a nde naa: « Un'lɔɔŋ, bi ikwen naa ngye akyer ntɔn bi undiir kalɔ̈ɔ̈m bi. » <verse eid="MRK 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36"/>Nde waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Ininà bɛ làkwen naa mɛ in'kyer ntɔn bɛ? » <verse eid="MRK 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37"/>Ba bun'fuur naa: « Ipɛ mbwo bi mubwaay u làkoo angye, umwɛy u kɔɔ angye là ibaal, wumwɛy u kɔɔ angye là ikaar. » <verse eid="MRK 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38"/>Yɛsu kàtɛn a ba naa: « Bɛ làyöbà anki undiir làlɔɔmà bɛ. Nkye bɛ làn'kwo munwà kɔɔb a mpay in'yànwà mɛ, itàkal naa muwal ndüümà ayin'yàwal mɛ? » <verse eid="MRK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39"/>Ba bàtɛn a nde naa: « Bi kan'kwo. » Yɛsu waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Kɔɔb in'yànwà mɛ, bɛ làkyer ayànwà la, ndüümà in'wal mɛ, bɛ làkyer ayàwal ya. <verse eid="MRK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40"/>Wɛɛ mubwaay u kɔɔ amɛ là ibaal itàkal là ikaar, kà mɛ anki an'kwo mupà: ikal abi byà ntɔn baar kàlɔ̈ɔ̈n Nzam bya. »<verse eid="MRK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41"/>Bàkwen bumwɛy bàwem ba ndaa ayin, ba bàmɛn Zyak anà Ywan ube. <verse eid="MRK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42"/>Apan Yɛsu kabel, waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Bɛ, bɛ làkyàyöb naa baar bàfàmɛnà asànaa amfum a in'sɛŋ bàfasà ungyɛl a in'kɔl aba, baar an'köl an'köl bàfàswaŋ ba ikɔ̈b aba. <verse eid="MRK 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43"/>Ya ikwe anki mukal abwɛy uboo abɛ. Wɛɛ isàkal naa mbuur akwen mukal wàkölàköl uboo abɛ, wɛy nde ukäl un'syääl abɛ, <verse eid="MRK 10:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44"/>mbuur wanswà akwen mukal wàtàtwɛb uboo abɛ, nde akal un'sɔ a baar banswà. <verse eid="MRK 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45"/>Lalan Mwan a mbuur kàyi anki ntɔn bun'syääl, wɛɛ nde kàyi ntɔn musyääl anà mupà mɔ̈ɔ̈ ande asànaa nkwiy ntɔn baar mbɔɔn. »<verse eid="MRK 10:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'kɔɔr ikwàmii Bartimɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Màt 20.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18.35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46"/>Ba bàtöl Yɛlikɔ. Umpal kàkäl Yɛsu mutoo u bul alan anà alɔŋki ande anà un'sɛŋ a baar mbɔɔn, ikwàmii Bartimɛ, mwan baal a Timɛ, kàkäl aŋàbwaay ukɔl a mbwo mulɔɔmà. <verse eid="MRK 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47"/>Mpal kàwem nde naa awɛy Yɛsu un'nsi Nasàlɛr kàkäl, nde kàsɛmà mukuub in'kwɛŋ: « Mwan a David, Yɛsu, nsyääm! » <verse eid="MRK 10:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48"/>Bàmbɔɔn bun'swɛŋà naa nde ukäl akul, wɛɛ nde kàsöönà mulaal: « Mwan a David, nsyääm! » <verse eid="MRK 10:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49"/>Yɛsu waa kàmbär, waa kàtɛn naa: « Lun'bel! » Ba bàbel ikwàmii, waa bàtɛn a nde naa: « Wal ibaal, mbarà, nde kàmabel. » <verse eid="MRK 10:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50"/>Apàn, nde kàpiy kàzak ande, waa kàmbarà, kàparà ntiin mukyà akà Yɛsu. <verse eid="MRK 10:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51"/>Yɛsu kun'fuul naa: « Ininà ngye akwen mɛ mukyer ntɔn ngye? » Ikwàmii kun'fuur naa: « Un'lɔɔŋ, wɛy mɛ in'fàman! » <verse eid="MRK 10:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52"/>Yɛsu kàtɛn a nde naa: « Kyen, làkwikilà angye làmatswà mɔ̈ɔ̈. » Apan sye nde waa kàfàman, waa kàyilabà Yɛsu u mbwo.<verse eid="MRK 10:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'bilà u Yɛlusàlɛm</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-9">Màt 21.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19.28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-16">Ywn 12.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1"/>Mpal bàtɔ̈l ba tsütsü a Yɛlusàlɛm, tsütsü a Bɛtfagɛ anà Bɛtani, mper a mɔŋ a In'te a Ɔlive, Yɛsu kàtöm abööl uboo alɔŋki ande, <verse eid="MRK 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2"/>waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Làkyen u bul lanà kusà a bɛ: Pa làkàbilà bɛ uboo a la, bɛ làkàman mwan a ntsür bàfàbel naa anɛs, udu awa mbuur ŋàtàlaar anki. Làtsuuŋ wa, lan'twääl awà. <verse eid="MRK 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3"/>Isàkal naa mbuur kan'tɛn a bɛ naa: "Ntɔn nkye làkyerà bɛ abun?" Lun'fuur naa: "Mwol we anà mfun a wa, waa làgyägyä nde ayàfuur wa apà." »<verse eid="MRK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4"/>Apan, ba waa bàkyen, waa bàmɛn mwan anɛ wàŋàbäm u nsà tsütsü a munàmbwo, u balàbal. Ba bàtsuuŋ wa. <verse eid="MRK 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5"/>Baar amwɛy bàkäl paa bafuul naa: « Ntɔn nkye làtsuuŋà bɛ mwan anɛ? » <verse eid="MRK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6"/>Ba bafuur asànaa kàtɛn Yɛsu, ba waa bawɛy musyen wa. <verse eid="MRK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7"/>Ba bàsyen mwan anɛ akà Yɛsu, waa bàyeel ipfɛy aba udu a wa, Yɛsu waa kàbwaay udu a wa. <verse eid="MRK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8"/>Baar mbɔɔn bàyeel ipfɛy aba u mbwo, bumwɛy ibwiy a nkay bàtsüülà ba kan'ywaŋ. <verse eid="MRK 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9"/>Baar bàyikyeenà kusà anà baar bàyilabà bàkäl muyisà in'kwɛŋ naa: « Ɔsana! Nsaak ikäl akà mbuur ayà kikɔb a Mwol! <verse eid="MRK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10"/>Nsaak ikal kà imwol kyan'yà, imwol a taaràbi David! Ɔsana kà ikal a dudu! »<verse eid="MRK 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11"/>Yɛsu kàkyen Yɛlusàlɛm, waa kàbilà u ndwà a Nzam. Ungö muler indiir byanswà byàkäl apà nde, taaŋ sye làkäl làŋàkyà, waa kàtoo, kàkyen Bɛtani anà Bàkwem Aŋiyweel.<verse eid="MRK 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'küül un'te a an'fige</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Màt 21.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12"/>Taaŋtyà, umpal bàtoo ba u Bɛtani, Yɛsu kàwen ngyal. <verse eid="MRK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13"/>Apan waa kàtääl un'te a an'fige kàkäl anà nkay, nde kàkàler wa naa nkye nde akyàman undiir mwɛy. Wɛɛ mpal kàsin nde tsütsü, nde kàmɛn nkay mpɛl, ntɔn la làkäl anki paŋà a an'fige. <verse eid="MRK 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14"/>Lalan kàtɛn nde a wa naa: « Wɛy mbuur mwɛy ukɔɔn asàdyà imbɛŋ angye akà ikikye! » Alɔŋki ande waa bàwem.<verse eid="MRK 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'böŋ ayääl u ndwà a Nzam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Màt 21.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19.45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Ywn 2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15"/>Ba bàtöl Yɛlusàlɛm. Yɛsu kàbilà u ndwà a Nzam, waa kàsɛmà muböŋ baar bàyäälà anà bàsöömà u ndwà a Nzam: nde kàbuum mɛsà a agyɛɛŋ a ngim anà an'kir a ayääl a nkokà, <verse eid="MRK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16"/>nde kàwɛy anki akà mbuur mwɛy mulyaaŋ anà undiir u ndwà a Nzam. <verse eid="MRK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17"/>Nde kàlɔɔŋà, waa kàtɛɛnà a ba naa: « Nkye bàsön anki naa: "Ndwà amɛ bàsabeelà ndwà a ngyamàkà ntɔn in'sɛŋ myanswà"? Wɛɛ bɛ, bɛ ya làkyàbuul mboo a mbüüb! »<verse eid="MRK 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18"/>Amfum a angaŋ anà alɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn bàwem ba ndaa ayin, ba bàleŋà mbwo mukun'dwa. Ntɔn ba bun'weemà bɔɔmà, ntɔn an'lɔɔŋ ande màtü un'sɛŋ a baar. <verse eid="MRK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19"/>Mpal làbü sisye, Yɛsu anà alɔŋki ande waa bàtoo u bul a kölàköl.<verse eid="MRK 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu anà un'te a an'fige wàŋàyɔm</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Màt 21.20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20"/>Mpal bàkal ba mulyaaŋ u tutu, ba bàmɛn un'te a an'fige wàŋàyɔm tii kà in'swɛy awa. <verse eid="MRK 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21"/>Petɔlà kàyɔbà nde, laa kàtɛn nde naa: « Un'lɔɔŋ, ler, un'te a an'fige akwà kàküül ngye kan'yɔm wanswà. » <verse eid="MRK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22"/>Yɛsu kafuur naa: « Làkäl anà làkwikilà akà Nzam. <verse eid="MRK 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23"/>Ndandaa mɛ alàkyään, isàkal naa mbuur kan'tɛn a mɔŋ wà naa: "Lwomà apan, kyen kàbü u ngyäl", ukɔɔn asà nkyɛɛr u mpem ande, wɛɛ nde usi làkwikilà naa ndaa kan'tɛn nde ikyer akwo, ya sye laa isàkwo ya ntɔn nde. <verse eid="MRK 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24"/>Lalan mɛ alàkyään naa: indiir byanswà làlɔm bɛ unsà ngyamàkà, làkäl anà làkwikilà naa bɛ bya lan'wal, bya byàbɛ. <verse eid="MRK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25"/>Umpal làwà bɛ umbäär u ngyamàkà, isàkal naa bɛ làwe anà nkir a mbuur, lun'dwääl nkul, waa Taaràbɛ awà u du uyàladwääl sye nkul a ibii abɛ. [ <verse eid="MRK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26"/>Wɛɛ bɛ làsàkɔɔn adwääl nkul a ibii, Taaràbɛ awà u du uyàladwääl anki sye nkul a ibii abɛ. ] »<verse eid="MRK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikɔ̈b a Yɛsu kyanfà ken?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Màt 21.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27"/>Ba ban'yàfurà Yɛlusàlɛm. Umpal kàkäl Yɛsu muyiyoolà uboo a ndwà a Nzam, amfum a angaŋ, alɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn anà andweer bàyàsin apà nde, <verse eid="MRK 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28"/>waa bàtɛn a nde naa: « Unsà ikɔ̈b nà akyerà ngye indiir abi? Itàkal naa nà kapɛ ikɔ̈b mukyer bya? » <verse eid="MRK 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29"/>Yɛsu kàtɛn a ba naa: « Mɛ alàsà mfuul mwɛy mpɛl, lan'fuur, waa mɛ in'yàtɛn a bɛ naa unsà ikɔ̈b nà mɛ in'kyerà indiir abi. <verse eid="MRK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30"/>Nkye ndüümà a Ywan yàfü du lɛɛ akà baar? Lan'fuur! » <verse eid="MRK 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31"/>Ba bàyweerà ba a ba naa: « Kya bi isàtɛn naa: "U du", nde ayifuul naa: "Ntɔn nkye mpa lun'si bɛ làkwikilà?" <verse eid="MRK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32"/>Wɛɛ, nkye bi itɛn naa: "Akà baar"...? - Ba bàtiinà un'sɛŋ a baar bɔɔmà, ntɔn ba banswà bàsii naa Ywan kàkäl ŋangɔɔm ndandaa. » <verse eid="MRK 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33"/>Lalan bàfuur ba akà Yɛsu naa: « Bi iyöb anki. » Apan Yɛsu waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Mɛ sye alàkyään anki unsà ikɔ̈b nà mɛ in'kyerà indiir abi. »<verse eid="MRK 11:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Itim a baar a isal abe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Màt 21.33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20.9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1"/>Apan Yɛsu kàsɛmà muyääm a ba unsà nsim naa: « Mbuur mwɛy kàkön ywaŋ a vin. Nde kàdiŋà la a làpaŋ. Nde kàtöŋ ikal mukaam mbɛŋ anà ndwà a ikyɛɛŋ. Ungö apan nde kàpɛ la akà baar musyääl a la, waa kàkyen. <verse eid="MRK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2"/>Utaaŋ mubwo, nde kàtöm un'syääl ande mwɛy akà baar bàfàkyer vin ntɔn muwal akà ba kab a isaa lànde. <verse eid="MRK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3"/>Baar abà bàtɛ un'syääl awà mpi, bun'düb, waa bun'fuur an'kɔɔ ipɔl. <verse eid="MRK 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4"/>Nde kàfatööm un'syääl asin. Awà sye, ba bun'düb kun'tswe, waa bun'tö. <verse eid="MRK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5"/>Nde kàtöm wàsin, wawun sye ba bàkyer un'dwà, anà bàsin sye mbɔɔn: bumwɛy bàkyer adüb, bumwɛy bàkyer adwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6"/>Nde kàsàsal awà nà mwan ande mwɛy mpɛl wà nkween. Nde kun'töm ungöngö, waa kàtɛn naa: "Ba bàyàkàkömà mwan amɛ." <verse eid="MRK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7"/>Wɛɛ baar bàfàkyer vin bàtɛn ba a ba naa: "Le ikyee ande. Làyi bi kun'dwä, waa ywaŋ làyàkal làbi!" <verse eid="MRK 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8"/>Apan, ba bun'tɛ mpi, bun'dwä, waa bun'tɔɔm unsà a ywaŋ a vin. »<verse eid="MRK 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9"/>« Apan ŋàywaŋ asàkyer aben? Nde akyer asàyà, akyɛr asàswaŋ baar mukadwa, waa usàpà ywaŋ akà baar asin. <verse eid="MRK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10"/>Nkye bɛ làtäŋ anki itiir a ndaa ki uboo a Ndaa Aŋàsɔn:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">"Nkɔŋ bàpiy atööŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">yàkyàbulà nkɔŋ a twɛrà.<verse eid="MRK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11"/>Ayi ndaa yàfü akà Mwol:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:11">ya yà ndaa ubem u mii a bi!" »<verse eid="MRK 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12"/>Ba bàleŋà ipöl mukun'kɔr, wɛɛ ba bàtiinà un'seŋ bɔɔmà. Ba bàkyer ayɔ̈b naa nde nsim ayi kàtɛ ntɔn ba. Apan ba bàsun'wɛy, waa bàkyen.<verse eid="MRK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Itɛr bàfür akà Sɛzar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Màt 22.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20.20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13"/>Ungö apan, ba bun'tööm Amfarisi amwɛy anà baar a Ɛlɔdi ntɔn ba bun'lwɛb ndaa u mbwo a ntɛɛn ande ŋakwo. <verse eid="MRK 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14"/>Ba bàyàtɛn a nde naa: « Un'lɔɔŋ, bi ikyàyöb naa ngye awà swalaa anà ngye afàlab anki ukwen a mbuur mwɛy: ngye afàler anki ntabwey a baar, wɛɛ ngye afàlɔŋ mbwo a Nzam unsà ndandaa. Nkye bàkyàpà mbwo, lɛɛ tɛy, mufur itɛr akà Sɛzar? Nkye bi ikyer afur lɛɛ ifur anki? » <verse eid="MRK 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15"/>Wɛɛ nde, abà kàyöb nde mpem yweel aba, nde kàtɛn a ba naa: « Ntɔn nkye làman'lwab bɛ? Lan'twääl itɛr a ngim, mɛ in'kwen muman kya. » <verse eid="MRK 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16"/>Ba bun'twääl imwɛy. Yɛsu waa kafuul naa: « Ntabwey anà ikɔb ki udu akya byà nà? » Ba bàfuur naa: « Byà Sɛzar. » <verse eid="MRK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17"/>Yɛsu waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Làpɛ indiir a Sɛzar akà Sɛzar, indiir a Nzam akà Nzam. » Ba bàkyer abemà ntɔn nde.<verse eid="MRK 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngwiiyà a akü</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Màt 22.23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20.27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18"/>Asadusu amwɛy ban'yà akà Yɛsu. Baar abà bàfàtɛn naa akü bàfàwiyà anki. Ba bun'fuulà abà: <verse eid="MRK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19"/>« Un'lɔɔŋ, Mɔsɛ kàsɔn abà ntɔn bi: "Isàkal naa baal mwɛy un'tɔŋ ande kan'kwà, kan'sàwɛy un'kaar, ukɔɔn awɛy baan, wɛy nde ubääl un'kweel un'dim awà ntɔn mupà un'tɔŋ ande mbɛŋ." <verse eid="MRK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20"/>Bàkäl anà atɔŋ nsambwaar. Wàtàtwɛb kàkyer abääl, waa kàkü ukɔɔn asàwɛy mwan. <verse eid="MRK 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21"/>Wàyweel kàbääl un'kaar awun, waa kàkü ukɔɔn asàwɛy mwan. Wàtär sye abun, <verse eid="MRK 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22"/>ba bànsambwaar bàsàwɛy anki akà mwan mwɛy. Ungö a ba bànswà, un'kaar sye waa kàkü. <verse eid="MRK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23"/>U ngwiiyà, mpal bàsàwiyà akü, nde asàkal un'kyay a nà uboo a ba? Ntɔn ba bànsambwaar bàkyer un'bääl! » <verse eid="MRK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24"/>Yɛsu kakyään naa: « Ntɔn bɛ làyöb anki Ndaa Aŋàsɔn, itàkal ngwal a Nzam, waa bɛ lan'diimà mbwo, kabwɛy anki? <verse eid="MRK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25"/>Abun, mpal bàsàwiyà baar uboo a akü, ba bàsàbääl anki akyay, itàkal adim, wɛɛ ba bàsàkal asànaa akyeey u du. <verse eid="MRK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26"/>Ntɔn ngwiiyà a akü, nkye bɛ làtäŋ anki, uboo a un'kaan a Mɔsɛ, unsà nsim a ibwiy a mbaa, ndaa kàtɛn Nzam a nde naa: "Mɛ in'wà Nzam a Abàlam, Nzam a Izak anà Nzam a Yakɔb." <verse eid="MRK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27"/>Nde kà wà Nzam a akü anki, wɛɛ wà baar a mɔ̈ɔ̈. Bɛ làkadiimà mbwo mbɔɔn. »<verse eid="MRK 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Un'kɔɔn kan'söön ndöŋ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Màt 22.34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28"/>Un'lɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn mwɛy awà kàwem nsyeel a mbaaŋ aba, kàkyer ayöb naa Yɛsu kafuur ubwaŋ, laa kàsin nde, waa kun'fuul naa: « Un'kɔɔn nà wàtàtwɛb unsà in'kɔɔn myanswà? » <verse eid="MRK 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29"/>Yɛsu kàfuur naa: « Wàtàtwɛb awà: "Isàlɛl, wem, Mwol Nzam abi, Mwol wà mwɛy, <verse eid="MRK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30"/>ngye ayàkwen Mwol Nzam angye unsà mpem angye yanswà, unsà mɔ̈ɔ̈ angye wanswà, unsà an'kyän angye manswà anà unsà ngwal angye yanswà." <verse eid="MRK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31"/>Wàyweel awà: "Ngye ayàkwen un'tɔŋ angye asànaa ngye ŋakwo." In'kɔɔn asin myatɛy myasöön ami. »<verse eid="MRK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32"/>Un'lɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn kàfàtɛn naa: « Un'lɔɔŋ, ngye an'tɛn ndandaa: Nde wà nde mpɛl, wàsin watɛy, <verse eid="MRK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33"/>waa, mukun'kwen u mpem ande yanswà, kun'yɛnà ande wanswà, u ngwal ande yanswà, anà mukwen un'tɔŋ ande asànaa nde ŋakwo, yan'söön ibɔɔn byanswà anà an'kab. » <verse eid="MRK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34"/>Yɛsu kàmɛn nde naa nde kan'fuur a un'yɛnà, waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Ngye kwel watɛy anà Imwol a Nzam. » Ungö apan, akà mbuur mwɛy kàfun'sà anki mfuul.<verse eid="MRK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Klistɔ anà David</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Màt 22.41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35"/>Apan, Yɛsu kàlɔɔŋà u ndwà a Nzam, waa kàtɛɛnà naa: « Ya ye aben naa alɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn ban'kwo mutɛn naa Klistɔ wà mwan a David? <verse eid="MRK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36"/>David ŋakwo kàtɛn u ngwal a Dwɛɛl In'kyɛɛl naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">"Mwol kàtɛn a mwol amɛ naa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">Bwaay u kɔɔ amɛ là ibaal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">tii mpal in'sàsà mɛ ayiiŋ angye u ngyɛl in'kɔl angye." <verse eid="MRK 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37"/>David ŋakwo kun'bel Mwol, apan nde mwan ande wà aben? »</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Un'sɛŋ a baar mbɔɔn kun'weemà unsà un'sak.<verse eid="MRK 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu wàmuswaŋ baar mukal kà igyɛɛŋ ntɔn alɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Màt 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luk 20.45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38"/>Unsà an'lɔɔŋ ande, nde kàtɛɛnà naa: « Làkäl kà igyɛɛŋ ntɔn alɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn: ba bàfàkwen muyilyaaŋ anà mvwɛl, naa bapɛ mbɔr kà ikal a nköŋ, <verse eid="MRK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39"/>bàfàsɔɔl an'kir amà kusà uboo a ndwà a nköŋ a Ayudà anà ikal atàtwɛb kà in'kyɔm. <verse eid="MRK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40"/>Ba bàfàduum indiir a akweel adim, taaŋ nsil alan ba bàfasà ngyamàkà a bwɛlàbwɛl. Nsaŋ aba isàkal yà kölàköl! »<verse eid="MRK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">An'kab kàpɛ un'kweel a un'dim wàŋàlàmbwà</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luk 21.1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41"/>Apan Yɛsu kàbwaay kusà a insak a an'kab, waa kàlerà naa baar bàkàsaa aben ngim uboo a kya. Aŋin'naaŋ bàmbɔɔn bàsye mbɔɔn. <verse eid="MRK 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42"/>Un'kweel a un'dim wàŋàlàmbwà waa kàyi, waa kàsi bitɛr a ngim ibyeel, byàsànten. <verse eid="MRK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43"/>Yɛsu kàbel alɔŋki ande, waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Ndandaa mɛ alàkyään, un'kweel a un'dim wàŋàlàmbwà wà kàn'sà yàŋàsöön baar banswà bàsaa uboo a insak. <verse eid="MRK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44"/>Ntɔn baar banswà ban'pà ngim ikɔ̈ɔ̈n ndöŋ akà ba. Wɛɛ nde, nde kan'wal unsà làmbwà ande ntɔn mupà yinà yanswà kàkäl nde ayà ntɔn mɔ̈ɔ̈ ande. »<verse eid="MRK 12:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kàkyään mbwabà a ndwà a Nzam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Màt 24.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21.5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1"/>Umpal kàkäl Yɛsu mutoo u ndwà a Nzam, umwɛy uboo a alɔŋki ande kàtɛn a nde naa: « Un'lɔɔŋ, le! In'kul nà myàkölàköl, ndwà nà yàkölàköl! » <verse eid="MRK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2"/>Yɛsu waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Ngye akimanà ndwà a kölàköl yi! Akà nkɔŋ mwɛy ifàsàsal anki udu a nkɔŋ yumwɛy. Ya yanswà ikyer asàbwabà. »<verse eid="MRK 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngyɛb anà nkwaaŋ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Màt 24.3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21.7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3"/>Yɛsu kàkäl aŋàbwaay u mɔŋ a in'te a ɔlive, kusà a ndwà a Nzam. Petɔlà, Zyak, Ywan anà Andrɛ bun'fuulà ukɔl naa: <verse eid="MRK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4"/>« Isam, mpal nà ndaa ayi isàyà, idiim nà isàswaŋ naa indiir abi byanswà ikyer asàkwo. »<verse eid="MRK 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5"/>Apan, Yɛsu kàsɛmà mutɛn a ba naa: « Làkäl kà igyɛɛŋ, mbuur twon amàlakur. <verse eid="MRK 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6"/>Ntɔn baar mbɔɔn bàsàyà kà ikɔb amɛ, waa bàsàtɛn naa: "Wà mɛ", waa ba bàsàkur baar mbɔɔn. <verse eid="MRK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7"/>Mpal làsàwem bɛ làsaŋ a ità anà in'bää a ità, twon lan'man bɔɔmà: yubwaŋ naa bya itàyà, wɛɛ bya kà isàkal ntsüü anki. <verse eid="MRK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8"/>Ntɔn un'sɛŋ mwɛy asànwaan a un'sɛŋ wumwɛy, imwol mwɛy a imwol kyumwɛy, kà ikal imwɛy imwɛy, mɛɛn ikyer asàtɛɛr, ngyal ikyer asàkal. Indiir abi byanswà byà nsɛmà a in'swaŋ. <verse eid="MRK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9"/>Làkäl kà igyɛɛŋ. Bàkyer asàlayälà u mbay a nsaŋ anà u ndwà a nköŋ a Ayudà, basàlakam iki, bɛ làsàkàsà in'lɔn kusà a amfum a itiir a mɛɛn anà kusà a amfum a nsi ntɔn mɛ: kya isàkal imbäl ntɔn ba. <verse eid="MRK 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10"/>Ntɔn Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ bàkyer atàkyään la akà in'sɛŋ myanswà. <verse eid="MRK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11"/>Mpal bàsàlasyen ntɔn mukàlayälà, twon lan'kyɛɛr kusà naa bɛ nkye làyàkàtɛn, wɛɛ ya bàsàlapà utaaŋ alan, làtɛn ya. Ntɔn kà bɛ anki làsàtwey mun, wɛɛ Dweelà Inkyɛɛl. <verse eid="MRK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12"/>Un'tɔŋ asàyälà un'tɔŋ ande ntɔn bun'dwä, taa asàyälà mwan ande, baan bàsàbɛy aböör aba, waa bàsatsüül ukwà. <verse eid="MRK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13"/>Baar banswà bàkyer asàlayiiŋ ntɔn ikɔb amɛ. Wɛɛ mbuur asàkaŋ mpem tii u ntsüü, asàwà mɔ̈ɔ̈.<verse eid="MRK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mpay aŋàdiir</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Màt 24.15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14"/>« Mpal làsàman bɛ lingyoomà aŋàdiir lan'bwaay kà ikal mpa lan'kwo la mukal, - wɛy mbuur akataŋà uyöb! Apan, wɛy baar bàsàkal u Yuday, bàtiin uboo a myɔŋ, <verse eid="MRK 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15"/>wɛy mbuur asàkal udu a mpaan a ndwà, ukɔɔn asàtɔlà ntɔn muwal undiir u ndwà ande, <verse eid="MRK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16"/>wɛy mbuur asàkal u ywaŋ, ukɔɔn afurà ndwà ntɔn mukàwal ipfɛy ande. <verse eid="MRK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17"/>Ngyɛb akà akaar bàsàkal anà an'yöm anà akakaar bàsànüü ilä abin! <verse eid="MRK 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18"/>Làyamà naa ndaa ayi ikɔ̈ɔ̈n asàyà u paŋà a làbe! <verse eid="MRK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19"/>Ntɔn, ilä abin isàkal ilä a mpay aŋàdiir mpa aŋàtàman fà nsɛmà a mɛɛn kàkyer Nzam tii papanà, anà ya ifàsàkal anki akà ikikye. <verse eid="MRK 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20"/>Yàlàkal naa Mwol ukɔɔn atyey ilä abi, akà mbuur mwɛy mɔ̈ɔ̈ kàlàwà anki. Wɛɛ, ntɔn baar kàsɔ̈ɔ̈l nde, nde kàtyey ilà abi. <verse eid="MRK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21"/>Abun, isàkal naa mbuur kan'tɛn a bɛ naa: "Le, Klistɔ awà kà!" Itàkal naa: "Le, awunà kunà!", twon làmukyey. <verse eid="MRK 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22"/>Ntɔn Aklistɔ a loor anà aŋangɔɔm a loor bàkyer asàtoo, waa bàsàkyer idiim anà impà ntɔn mukur, itàkal sye baar aŋàsɔɔl, kya mbwo isàkal. <verse eid="MRK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23"/>Abun bɛ, bɛ làkäl kà igyɛɛŋ! Indiir abi byanswà mɛ kàkyàlaweey kusà.<verse eid="MRK 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngyeel a Mwan a mbuur</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Màt 24.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24"/>« Wɛɛ kà ilä abin, ungö a mpay aŋàdiir ayin, taaŋ làsàbwà làpib, nsöŋ ufàsàpà anki kyɛɛy awa, <verse eid="MRK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25"/>mbwaar isàfà du waa isàbwà, ngwal a du ikyer asàni. <verse eid="MRK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26"/>Apan ba bàsàman Mwan a mbuur wàmuyà uboo a un'böŋ unsà ngwal mbɔɔn anà làkoo. <verse eid="MRK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27"/>Apan nde asàtɔm akyeey anà asàböbà baar kàsɔ̈ɔ̈l nde kà an'twɛrà man'nà, fà nswɛŋ a mɛɛn tii u nswɛŋ a du.<verse eid="MRK 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">An'lɔɔŋ a un'te a fige</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Màt 24.32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21.29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28"/>« Làyöb lwɛŋ lan'fà uboo a nsim a un'te a fige: an'kɔkà màsàbulà bɔɔlàbɔɔl, nkay isàfulà, bɛ lan'yöb naa un'tye wà tsütsü. <verse eid="MRK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29"/>Asànaa bɛ sye, mpal làsàman bɛ indiir abi byan'yà, làyöb naa Mwan a mbuur wà tsütsü u munàmbwo. <verse eid="MRK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30"/>Ndandaa mɛ alàkyään: nkööl ayi isàlyaŋ anki kusà ndaa ayi yanswà mukwo. <verse eid="MRK 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31"/>Du anà mɛɛn màkyer asàlyaaŋ, wɛɛ ndaa amɛ isàlyaaŋ anki akà ikikye.<verse eid="MRK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzam mpɛl ayöb ilä a ntsüü</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Màt 24.36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32"/>« Wɛɛ ilä kya itàkal taaŋ la, akà mbuur mwɛy uyöb anki bya, itàkal akyeey a du, itàkal Mwan, akà mbuur mwɛy, nà Taa mpɛl. <verse eid="MRK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33"/>Làkäl kà igyɛɛŋ, làduub mii abɛ, ntɔn bɛ làyöb anki mpal nà ya isàkwo. <verse eid="MRK 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34"/>Ya isàkal asànaa mbuur mwɛy kan'kàlyaaŋ: nde an'sàwɛy ndwà ande, an'sàpà ikɔ̈b akà asyääl ande, mbuur mbuur anà isal ande, waa uswaŋ un'kyɛɛŋ a munàmbwo muduub mii. <verse eid="MRK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35"/>Lalan, làduub mii, ntɔn bɛ làyöb anki mpal usàyà nkum a ndwà, làsisye lɛɛ u mpöŋàmpöŋ, u mbeel a nkɔ lɛɛ u tutu, <verse eid="MRK 13:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36"/>manà nde uyà kà imbürà, waa kàlaman bàŋàbɔ̈ɔ̈n. <verse eid="MRK 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37"/>Ndaa in'tɛɛnà mɛ yi a bɛ, mɛ in'tɛɛnà a baar banswà: Làduub mii! »<verse eid="MRK 13:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Ndiirà ntɔn mudwà Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Màt 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Ywn 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1"/>Byàsäl ilä ibyeel Pak anà un'kyɔm a mampà ikɔ̈ɔ̈n ful mukwo, amfum a angaŋ anà alɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn bàleŋà impeenà mukɔr Yɛsu, waa bun'dwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2"/>Ntɔn ba bàtɛɛnà naa: « Kà uboo a un'kyɔm anki, manà lingyoomà layàbilà uboo a un'sɛŋ. »<verse eid="MRK 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Un'kaar mwɛy kan'tsuul Yɛsu may a usɔŋ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Màt 26.6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Ywn 12.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3"/>Yɛsu kàkäl u Bɛtani u ndwà a Simɔn ŋabay, mpal kàkäl nde u mɛsà mudyà, un'kaar mwɛy kàyi anà làbuuŋ aŋàyɔl a may a usɔŋ a ndandaa màntal mbɔɔn. Nde kàduub la, waa kun'tsüül udu a un'tswe. <verse eid="MRK 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4"/>Baar bumwɛy bàkäl paa bàmɛn ube, waa bàtɛɛnà ba a ba naa: « Ntɔn nkye mubi may a usɔŋ amà abà? <verse eid="MRK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5"/>Yàlàbwaŋ naa bàyälà ma màŋàsɔ̈ɔ̈nà nkam tär yà itɛr a ngim, waa bàlàpà aŋàlàmbwà! » Ba bàpɛlà un'kaar awà. <verse eid="MRK 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6"/>Wɛɛ Yɛsu kàtɛn naa: « Lun'si a duu. Ntɔn nkye lun'paa bɛ mpay? Nde kan'kyer undiir aŋàbwaŋ akà mɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7"/>Ntɔn aŋàlàmbwà bɛ làbà anà ba taaŋ lanswà, bɛ lan'kwo mukakyer ubwaŋ mpal làkwen bɛ, wɛɛ mɛ, mɛ anà bɛ watɛy taaŋ lanswà. <verse eid="MRK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8"/>Undiir kàkwen nde mukyer, nde kan'kyer wa: kusà nde kan'tsuul ndür amɛ may a usɔŋ ntɔn ndyee aya. <verse eid="MRK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9"/>Ndandaa mɛ alàkyään, ntsü yanswà bàsàpay Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ, u mɛɛn manswà, bàsataa ndaa kan'kyer un'kaar wà ntɔn muyɔbà mɔ̈ɔ̈ ande. »<verse eid="MRK 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yudas akwen muyälà Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Màt 26.14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22.3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10"/>Yudas Iskaryɔt, umwɛy uboo a alɔŋki Kwem Aŋiyweel, kàkyen akà amfum a angaŋ ntɔn mukàyàlà Yɛsu. <verse eid="MRK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11"/>Ba bàkäl kà un'sak ntɔn làsaŋ alan. Ba bàdirà mukun'pà ngim. Apan nde kàleŋà ipöl aŋàbwaŋ mukun'yälà.<verse eid="MRK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngyööŋà adyà Pak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Màt 26.17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luk 22.7-14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Ywn 13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12"/>Ilä atàtwɛb kyà mampà ikɔ̈ɔ̈n ful, ilä bàfàdwa in'tö a in'kɔk ntɔn isaa a Pak, alɔŋki a Yɛsu ban'tɛn a nde naa: « Ikal nà ngye akwen bi ikàyilà ntɔn ngye akàdyà Pak? » <verse eid="MRK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13"/>Apan Yɛsu kàtöm alɔŋki ande bɔ̈ɔ̈l, waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Làkyen u bul a kölàköl, bɛ làkàman baal mwɛy we anà làbuuŋ a an'dà ayàmɛɛn anà bɛ, lun'läb. <verse eid="MRK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14"/>Ikal kyanswà ukàbilà nde, làtɛn akà ŋàndwà naa: "Un'lɔɔŋ kan'tɛn naa: Làken suk in'dyà mɛ Pak anà alɔŋki amɛ?" <verse eid="MRK 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15"/>Nde akàlaswaŋ suk a du làkölàköl làŋakwo anà indiir byanswà. Ngiil ntɔn bi, bɛ làkàkyer kwo. » <verse eid="MRK 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16"/>Alɔŋki bàkyen ba, bàtɔ̈l ba u bul a kölàköl, ba bàmɛn asànaa kàtɛn nde a ba, waa bàyöŋà Pak.<verse eid="MRK 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17"/>Mpal làbü sisye, Yɛsu kàyi anà Bàkwem Aŋiyweel. <verse eid="MRK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18"/>Umpal bàkäl ba u mɛsà bàmudyà, nde kàtɛn naa: « Ndandaa mɛ alàkyään, umwɛy uboo a bɛ awàmudyà anà mɛ, akyer ayan'yälà. » <verse eid="MRK 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19"/>Alɔŋki bàmɛn ngyɛb mbɔɔn, waa bàsɛmà mukun'fuul umwɛy umwɛy: « Nkye an'kwo ikäl mɛ? » <verse eid="MRK 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20"/>Nde kàtɛn a ba naa: « Umwɛy uboo a Bàkwem Aŋiyweel, kan'dümà kɔɔ ande mbwo mwɛy anà mɛ uboo làlɔŋà. <verse eid="MRK 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21"/>Ntɔn Mwan a mbuur akyer akyà asànaa bàsön ya ntɔn nde, wɛɛ ngyɛb akà mbuur ban'yälà Mwan a mbuur u mbwo a nde! Yàlàkal ubwaŋ mbɔɔn akà nde naa bàkɔɔn un'bɔr! »<verse eid="MRK 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Udyà a in'kyɛɛl</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Màt 26.26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:15-20">Luk 22.15-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Kɔ 11.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22"/>Utaaŋ adyà, Yɛsu kàwɛl mampà, ungö musaak ma, nde kàtsül ma, waa kapɛ, waa kàtɛn naa: « Làwɛl, ayi yà ndür amɛ. » <verse eid="MRK 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23"/>Waa kàwɛl kɔɔb, ungö mufuur an'tɔɔn, nde kapɛ la, waa ba banswà bànü unsà la. <verse eid="MRK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24"/>Yɛsu kàtɛn a ba naa: « Amà an'kil amɛ, an'kil a nkwà màtyaŋà ntɔn bàmbɔɔn. <verse eid="MRK 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25"/>Ndandaa mɛ alàkyään: mɛ in'fàsànwà anki akà ikikye vin tii ilä in'sànwà mɛ vin akün kà imwol a Nzam. » <verse eid="MRK 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26"/>Ungö mutɔɔl an'diim, ba bàtoo ntɔn mukyà mɔŋ a in'te a Ɔlive.<verse eid="MRK 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'kyään ntöön a Petɔlà</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Màt 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22.31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Ywn 13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27"/>Yɛsu kàtɛn a ba naa: « Bɛ, bɛ banswà làkyer asan'kɔɔb, ntɔn bàsön naa: "Mɛ in'sàdwa un'kyɛɛŋ, waa in'kɔk isàtà upay." <verse eid="MRK 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28"/>Wɛɛ mɛ, ungö a ngwiiyà, mɛ in'sàfweel kusà a bɛ u Ngalilɛ. » <verse eid="MRK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29"/>Petɔlà kàtɛn a nde naa: « Itàkal naa baar banswà bàmakɔɔb, wɛɛ mɛ, mɛ in'sakɔɔb anki. » <verse eid="MRK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30"/>Yɛsu waa utɛn a nde naa: « Ndandaa mɛ akyään: ŋàbawà, mpib nsil ayi, kusà nkɔɔ mubel mbalà yweel, ngye, ngye ayan'tɔn mbalà tär. » <verse eid="MRK 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31"/>Wɛɛ nde, nde kàfàfuur a ngwal: « Mɛ, itàkal naa mɛ in'kyer akwà anà ngye, aay, mɛ ngye in'satɔn tɛy. » Ba banswà bàkäl mun mwɛy wa.<verse eid="MRK 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu u Ngɛtɛsɛmani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Màt 26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22.39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32"/>Apan ba bàyàkɔlà kà ikal mwɛy bàfàbel naa Ngɛtɛsɛmani, Yɛsu waa kàtɛn a alɔŋki ande naa: « Sàlàbwaay pà, umpal in'kàyamà mɛ. » <verse eid="MRK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33"/>Ungö nde kàsyen Petɔlà, Yakɔb anà Ywan. Apan nde kàsɛmà muwem matɛɛr anà ngyɛb mbɔɔn. <verse eid="MRK 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34"/>Nde kàtɛn a ba naa: « Mɔ̈ɔ̈ amɛ wàŋàyɔl a ngyɛb yan'kwo mudwa. Sàlasäl pà, làkyɛŋ. » <verse eid="MRK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35"/>Nde kàkyen u kikwɛl, waa kàbü an'köm, kàyamà naa kya mbwo isàkal, taaŋ alà làlyaaŋ ukwɛl apà nde. <verse eid="MRK 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36"/>Nde kàtɛɛnà naa: « Taa, indiir byanswà akà ngye ikyer afàkwo, lwom kɔɔb a mpay aŋàkir là apà mɛ. Itàkal abwɛy, kà ndaa in'kwen mɛ anki, wɛɛ ayan'kwen ngye. » <verse eid="MRK 14:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37"/>Ungö apan nde kan'yà, kan'man ba bàŋàbɔ̈ɔ̈n, waa kan'tɛn a Petɔlà: « Simɔn, ngye an'bɔ̈ɔ̈n? Nkye ngye asàkal anki anà ngwal mukyɛŋ itàkal akà taaŋ làmwɛy? <verse eid="MRK 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38"/>Làkyɛŋ, làyamà, ntɔn bɛ làkɔ̈ɔ̈n abwà u ndɛb. Dweelà làŋàyɔl a ngwal, wɛɛ ndür ye anà gyɔ̈ɔ̈là. » <verse eid="MRK 14:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39"/>Nde kàfàkyà u kikwɛl, waa kàyamà wàmufuur ndaa nsil ya. <verse eid="MRK 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40"/>Apan, nde kàyi mbalà asin, waa kàfaman bàmubɔ̈ɔ̈n, ntɔn mii aba myàkäl myàŋàbwà buur. Ba waa mpa bàyöb naa bun'fuur aben. <verse eid="MRK 14:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41"/>U mbalà yàtär kan'yà nde, nde kan'tɛn a ba naa: « Làläb mubɔ̈ɔ̈n, làyöör. Yan'wà! Taaŋ lan'kwo: le, Mwan a mbuur bàmuyälà kà an'kɔɔ a baar abe. <verse eid="MRK 14:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42"/>Làmbarà, tsweenà! Làler, mbuur kàman'yälà wà tsütsü. »<verse eid="MRK 14:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nköör a Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Màt 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22.47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Ywn 18.3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43"/>Umpal kàkäl nde muyäämà, Yudasi, umwɛy uboo a Bàkwem Aŋiyweel, kàyàkɔlà anà iköŋ a baar mbɔɔn bàtöm andweer a angaŋ anà andweer a un'sɛŋ. Ba bàkäl anà an'kɔm anà nköl. <verse eid="MRK 14:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44"/>Mbuur kun'yälà, kapɛ idiim ki: « Mbuur wanswà in'kàböbà mɛ, mbuur wa nde awun. Lun'kör, lun'syen unsà ikyɛɛŋ. » <verse eid="MRK 14:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45"/>Pa kàyàkɔlà nde, nde kàsin apà Yɛsu, waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Un'lɔɔŋ! » Waa kun'böbà. <verse eid="MRK 14:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46"/>Apan bumwɛy bun'tɛ mpi, waa bun'kör. <verse eid="MRK 14:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47"/>Umwɛy uboo a baar bàkäl paa, kàtwey kɔm, waa kàkäm un'syääl a Mfum a angaŋ, waa kun'tsül tsü. <verse eid="MRK 14:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48"/>Yɛsu kàtɛn a ba naa: « Nkye mɛ in'wà un'dwää baar waa bɛ làyi anà an'kɔm anà nköl ntɔn mukan'kɔr? <verse eid="MRK 14:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49"/>Mɛ kàkäl anà bɛ u ndwà a Nzam ilä byanswà mulɔŋ, bɛ làsan'kɔr anki. Wɛɛ ayi yan'yà ntɔn Ndaa Aŋàsɔn ikwe. » <verse eid="MRK 14:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50"/>Apan ba banswà bàsun'wɛy, waa bàtiin. <verse eid="MRK 14:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51"/>Mwan baal mwɛy wàŋàbwaar làpye làmwɛy mpɛl waa kàyun'labà. Waa bun'kör, <verse eid="MRK 14:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52"/>wɛɛ nde kàsàpiy làpye alan, waa kàtiin wànsàpɔl.<verse eid="MRK 14:52"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu u Làbay a nsaŋ a kölàköl</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Màt 26.57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk 22.54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Ywn 18.13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53"/>Ba bàsyen Yɛsu akà mfum a angaŋ, ikal bàköŋ amfum a angaŋ bànswà, andweer anà alɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn. <verse eid="MRK 14:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54"/>Petɔlà kàyilabà Yɛsu ukwel tii uboo a làpaŋ, u làbay a ndwà a mfum a angaŋ. Nde kàbwaay anà aŋità muywar mbaa.<verse eid="MRK 14:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55"/>Kyekà andweer a angaŋ anà Làbay a nsaŋ a kölàköl bàkäl muleŋ imbäl a loor ntɔn Yɛsu ntɔn bun'dwä, wɛɛ ba kya bàmɛnà anki. <verse eid="MRK 14:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56"/>Ntɔn bàmbɔɔn bàtɛɛ imbäl a loor ntɔn nde, wɛɛ bya byàkyeena anki balàbal. <verse eid="MRK 14:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57"/>Baar amwɛy waa bàyàmbarà, waa bàyataa loor ntɔn nde naa: <verse eid="MRK 14:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58"/>« Bi kàwem nde wàmutɛn naa: "Mɛ in'yàbwaab ndwà a Nzam bàtöŋ yi kàn'kɔɔ a baar, wɛɛ ungö a ilä itär mɛ in'yàtɔŋ yàsin mpa bàkyer kan'kɔɔ a baar." » <verse eid="MRK 14:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59"/>Wɛɛ, itàkal abà, imbäl aba kyàkwe anki balàbal. <verse eid="MRK 14:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60"/>Apan Mfum a angaŋ kàmbarà nde uboo a nköŋ, nde kàfuul Yɛsu naa: « Nkye ngye afuur anki akà undiir mwɛy unsà imbäl bàtaa baar bà ntɔn ngye? » <verse eid="MRK 14:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61"/>Wɛɛ Yɛsu kàkäl akul, waa mpa kàfuur akà ikikye. Mfum a angaŋ kun'fuul mbalà asin: « Nkye ngye awà Klistɔ, Mwan a Nzam aŋàsaak? » <verse eid="MRK 14:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62"/>Yɛsu waa kàfuur naa: « Mɛ in'wà nde, bɛ làsàman Mwan a mbuur waŋàbwaay u kɔɔ ibaal a Ŋangwal, wàmuyà uboo in'böŋ a du. » <verse eid="MRK 14:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63"/>Apan, Mfum a angaŋ kàkaam ipfɛy ande, waa kàtɛn naa: « Bi ambäl nkye ifàkyer abà! <verse eid="MRK 14:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64"/>Bɛ lan'wem mbɛɛy. Bɛ lan'tɛn aben? » Ba banswà bun'tsüül mbar a ukwà. <verse eid="MRK 14:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65"/>Bamwɛy uboo a ba bun'tsüülà an'te, bun'fwee ntabwey, bun'kämà iki, waa bàtɛɛnà a nde naa: « Tà ngɔɔm! » Aseey waa bun'yab a mbar.<verse eid="MRK 14:65"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petɔlà kan'tɔn Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Màt 26.69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22.56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Ywn 18.15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66"/>Petɔlà kàkäl u ngyɛl uboo a làpaŋ umpal kàyi un'syääl mwɛy wun'kaar wà mfum a angaŋ, <verse eid="MRK 14:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67"/>nde kàmɛn Petɔlà wàmuywar mbaa, nde kun'syebà, waa kàtɛn a nde naa: « Ngye sye, ngye kàkäl anà Yɛsu un'nsi Nasàlɛr. » <verse eid="MRK 14:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68"/>Wɛɛ nde kàkyer atɔn, waa kàtɛn naa: « Mɛ in'yöb anki. Mɛ in'yöb anki naa ngye nkye akwen mutɛn. » Ungö, waa kàtoo u nsà mukyà ikal bàfabilà. [ Apan nkɔɔ waa kàbel. ] <verse eid="MRK 14:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69"/>Un'syääl wun'kaar kun'mɛn nde, waa kàfàtɛn a baar bàkäl paa naa: « Mbuur wà, wà umwɛy uboo a ba! » <verse eid="MRK 14:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70"/>Wɛɛ nde waa kàfàtɔn. Ungö apan, baar bàkäl paa bàfàtɛn a Petɔlà naa: « Ndandaa, ngye awà umwɛy uboo a ba, ntɔn ngye, ngye awà un'nsi Ngalilɛ. » <verse eid="MRK 14:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71"/>Wɛɛ nde kàsɛmà mudyà kyän anà musà in'küül: « Mɛ un'yöb anki mbuur lan'saamà bɛ. » <verse eid="MRK 14:71"/><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72"/>Utaaŋ nsil alan, nkɔɔ mwɛy waa kàbel u mbalà yàyweel, apan Petɔlà kàyɔbà ndaa kun'kyään Yɛsu: « Kusà nkɔɔ mutàbel mbalà yweel, ngye ayan'tɔn mbalà tär. » Apan, nde kàtoo u ntiin, waa kàlel.<verse eid="MRK 14:72"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kusà a Pilatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Màt 27.1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Ywn 18.28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1"/>U tutu tutu, amfum a angaŋ bàköŋ anà andweer, anà alɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn anà Làbay a nsaŋ làkölàköl lanswà. Ba bàbäm Yɛsu in'siŋ, bun'syen anà bun'pɛ akà Pilatu. <verse eid="MRK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2"/>Pilatu waa kun'fuul naa: « Nkye ngye awà mfum a Ayudà? » Yɛsu waa kun'fuur naa: « Ngye ŋàkwo an'tɛn. » <verse eid="MRK 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3"/>Amfum a angaŋ bun'füünà indiir mbɔɔn. <verse eid="MRK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4"/>Pilatu kàfun'fuulà naa: « Nkye ngye ndaa afuur anki akà ikikye? Ngye akiweemà indiir mbɔɔn bàfüünà ba ngye! » <verse eid="MRK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5"/>Wɛɛ Yɛsu kàsàfuur anki akà ndaa mwɛy, abun Pilatu waa kàbem.<verse eid="MRK 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu bàmutsüül mbar a ukwà</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Màt 27.15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23.13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Ywn 18.39-19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6"/>Kà un'kyɔm wanswà, Pilatu kàkäl anà nkääl mutsuuŋ mbuur a bɔlokà mwɛy, mbuur kàlɔ̈ɔ̈mà un'sɛŋ. <verse eid="MRK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7"/>Kyekà mbuur mwɛy ikɔb ande Barabas kàkäl u bɔlokà anà aŋàlingyoomà abà bàdwä mbuur umpal làbü lingyoomà. <verse eid="MRK 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8"/>Un'sɛŋ a baar kàbeenà, waa kàsɛmà mukun'lɔ̈ɔ̈m naa nde kapɛ asànaa nkääl ande. <verse eid="MRK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9"/>Pilatu kàfuul naa: « Nkye bɛ làkyàkwen mɛ alàwɛɛy mfum a Ayudà? » <verse eid="MRK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10"/>Ntɔn nde kàkyer ayöb naa ba Yɛsu bun'yälà ntɔn un'köl aba. <verse eid="MRK 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11"/>Wɛɛ amfum a angaŋ bàsiinà un'sɛŋ ntɔn Pilatu katsuuŋ awà Barabas. <verse eid="MRK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12"/>Pilatu kàfàtɛn a ba naa: « Abun bɛ làkwen naa mɛ nkye in'kyer anà mbuur làfàbel bɛ mfum a Ayudà? » <verse eid="MRK 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13"/>Ba bàfàsà in'kwɛŋ: « Un'bɛɛrà u kulunsi! » <verse eid="MRK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14"/>Pilatu kàtɛɛnà a ba naa: « Ube nà nde kàkyer bà? » Wɛɛ ba bàsöönà musà in'kwɛŋ: « Un'bɛɛrà u kulunsi! » <verse eid="MRK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15"/>Pilatu kàkwen mupà un'sɛŋ un'sak, waa katsuuŋ Barabas. Apan nde kàswɛŋ naa bàkäm Yɛsu an'füm, waa kun'yälà ntɔn bun'bɛɛrà u kulunsi.<verse eid="MRK 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aŋità bàmusɛɛ Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Màt 27.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Ywn 19.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16"/>Aŋità bàsyen Yɛsu uboo a làpaŋ a kuvɛrnɔ̈ɔ̈r u pɛlàtwal, waa bàbel làböl lanswà. <verse eid="MRK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17"/>Ba bun'bwää kàzak a tsöö, waa bun'tɔ̈ɔ̈l mpà a nsyeenà bàtöŋ ba kun'tswe. <verse eid="MRK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18"/>Ba bàsɛmà mukun'pà mbɔr naa: « Mbɔr, mfum a Ayudà! » <verse eid="MRK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19"/>Ba bun'kämà un'bii kun'tswe, bun'tsüülà an'te, anà bàbwee an'köm kusà ande ntɔn mukömà. <verse eid="MRK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20"/>Ungö amukun'sɛɛ, ba bun'lwom kàzak a tsöö, waa bun'fuur ipfɛy ande. Apan ba bun'twey u nsà a bul ntɔn bàkun'bɛɛrà u kulunsi.<verse eid="MRK 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu bàmun'bɛɛrà u kulunsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Màt 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23.26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Ywn 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21"/>Mbuur mwɛy, ikɔb ande Simɔn, un'nsi Sirɛn, taar a Alɛksandre anà Rufus, kàfü ndwaŋ, anà kàkäl mulyaaŋ. Aŋità bun'siinà a ngwal musyen kulunsi. <verse eid="MRK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22"/>Ba bàsyen Yɛsu kà ikäl mwɛy ikɔb a kya Ngɔlàngɔta, ikaswaŋà naa: « Ikal a köl a un'tswe. » <verse eid="MRK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23"/>Ba bun'pɛɛ vin aŋàtüüb a dyam, wɛɛ Yɛsu kàtön munwà la. <verse eid="MRK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24"/>Ungö bun'bɛɛrà ba u kulunsi, ba bàkäbà ipfɛy ande, waa bàtɛɛ löb ntɔn muyöb naa mbuur mbuur ininà uwal. <verse eid="MRK 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25"/>Ba bun'bɛɛrà u kulunsi u taaŋ làwà làtutu. <verse eid="MRK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26"/>Isin a ndaa bàsön muswaŋ ntsüül a ukwà ande yàkäl abà: « Mfum a Ayudà. » <verse eid="MRK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27"/>Ba bàbɛɛrà sye baar abe abɔ̈ɔ̈l u bikulunsi ukɔl a Yɛsu, mwɛy u kɔɔ ande là ibaal, umwɛy u kɔɔ ande là ikaar. [ <verse eid="MRK 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28"/>Apan itiir a Ndaa Aŋàsɔn yi laa kyàkwe kya: « Nde bun'täŋ unsà ulwaŋ a baar abe. » ]<verse eid="MRK 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29"/>Baar bàlyaaŋà u mbwo bun'töö, bànii in'tswe, waa bàtɛɛnà naa: « Imbye itàkal ngye atàman! Ngye awee naa abwiy ndwà a Nzam, waa afàtɔŋ ya kà ilä itär, <verse eid="MRK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30"/>tswà mɔ̈ɔ̈ angye, ngye ŋankwo, tɔlà u kulunsi! » <verse eid="MRK 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31"/>Amfum a angaŋ anà alɔɔŋ a in'kɔɔn bàsɛɛ, ba a ba, waa bàtɛɛnà naa: « Nde kàtsü baar asin mɔ̈ɔ̈, wɛɛ nde ukwe anki mutswà mɔ̈ɔ̈ nde ŋakwo! <verse eid="MRK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32"/>Wɛy Klistɔ, mfum a Isàlɛl utɔlà apanà u kulunsi, waa bi iman, waa bi isà làkwikilà! » Baar bàbɛɛrà u kulunsi mbwo mwɛy anà nde, bun'töö sye.<verse eid="MRK 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkweel a Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33"/>U midi làpib làkyer abwà u mɛɛn manswà tii u taaŋ làtär ungö a midi. <verse eid="MRK 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34"/>Apan, u taaŋ làtär, Yɛsu kàsi un'kwɛŋ a ngwal: « Ɛlɔyi, Ɛlɔyi, lɛma sabaktani? » Ikaswaŋà naa: « Nzam a mɛ, Nzam a mɛ, ntɔn nkye aman'wɛy ngye? » - <verse eid="MRK 15:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35"/>Bamwɛy uboo a baar bàkäl paa bun'weemà ba, waa bàtɛɛnà naa: « Làwem, nde kan'bel Ɛli! » <verse eid="MRK 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36"/>Mbuur mwɛy kàkaamà ntiin, kànwɛmà ikaam a ipfɛy unsà vin a nkyään, nde kàbäm kya u nswɛŋ a un'bii, waa kàsilà kya akà Yɛsu ntɔn nde unü, wàmutɛn naa: « Làdil, bi iler naa nkye Ɛli akyun'tɔɔl u kulunsi! » <verse eid="MRK 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37"/>Wɛɛ Yɛsu kàsi un'kwɛŋ a ngwal, waa un'swey kàtoo.<verse eid="MRK 15:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38"/>Rido a idwà làkaamà itiir byeel fà du tii u ngyɛl. <verse eid="MRK 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39"/>Kaptɛn kàkäl paa kusà a nde, mpal kàmɛn nde naa nde kàkü aben, waa kàtɛn naa: « Ndandaa mbuur wà kàkäl Mwan a Nzam! » <verse eid="MRK 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40"/>Bàkäl anà akaar amwɛy sye bàleerà ukwɛl. Uboo a ba, bàkäl Màlye un'nsi Magàdala, Màlye ngwän a Zyak Un'kye, anà Yɔsɛ, anà Salɔmɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41"/>Ba bàkäl akaar bàyun'labà anà bàyun'syäälà mpal kàkäl nde u Ngalilɛ, anà akaar asin mbɔɔn bàbeenà Yɛlusàlɛm anà nde.<verse eid="MRK 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu bàmusà kà an'dii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Màt 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23.50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Ywn 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42"/>Sisye làkäl aŋàbwà, kya kyàkal ilä ayöŋà, iswaŋà naa ilä kyàfweel saba, <verse eid="MRK 15:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43"/>un'byääl mwɛy wà làbay a nsaŋ, Yɔsɛfi un'nsi Alimatɛ, kàyàkɔlà paa. Nde sye kàfadilà Imwol a Nzam. Nde kàwɛl ibaal mukyà akà Pilatu ntɔn mulɔm ndom a Yɛsu. <verse eid="MRK 15:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44"/>Pilatu kàbem muwem naa nde abwà akwà. Nde kàbel kaptɛn, waa kun'fuul naa nkye nde kàkü itaan. <verse eid="MRK 15:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45"/>Ungö kàyöb nde u mbwo a kaptɛn, nde kàpɛ mbwo akà Yɔsefi muwal ndom. <verse eid="MRK 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46"/>Ungö musom làpye a pɛɛl, nde kàtɔɔl ndom u kulunsi, kàläl ya uboo a làpye, kàsi ya kà an'dii bàfuun uboo a nkɔŋ, waa kàbuum nkɔŋ a kölàköl ntɔn mudübà an'dii. <verse eid="MRK 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47"/>Màlye un'nsi Magàdalà anà Màlye ngwän a Yɔsɛ bàleerà ikal basi ndom.<verse eid="MRK 15:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Ngwiiyà a Yɛsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Màt 28.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Ywn 20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1"/>Ungö ilä a saba, Màlye un'nsi Magàdalà, anà Sàlomɛ anà Màlye ngwän a Zyak, bàsöm may a usɔŋ ntɔn mumwaŋ u ndür a Yɛsu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2"/>Ilä atàtwɛb kyà mpɔsà, ba bàkyen an'dii u tutu, mpal làsɛnà taaŋ. <verse eid="MRK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3"/>Ba bàtɛɛnà ba a ba naa: « Nà akà ibuum nkɔŋ yinà u mun a an'dii? » <verse eid="MRK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4"/>Wɛɛ umpal bàler ba, ba bàmɛn naa nkɔŋ yàkäl aŋàbuum ukɔl. <verse eid="MRK 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5"/>Ba bàbilà uboo a an'dii, bàmɛn un'tö mwɛy wàŋàbwaay u kɔɔ ibaal, akyàbwaar mvwɛl a pɛɛl. Matɛɛr waa mawɛl. <verse eid="MRK 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6"/>Wɛɛ nde kàtɛn a ba naa: « Twon lan'man bɔɔmà, bɛ làwàmuleŋ Yɛsu un'nsi Nasàlɛr awà bàbɛɛrà u kulunsi. Nde akyàwiyà, nde ufàkal anki apà. Làler ikal bun'tɔ̈ɔ̈l. <verse eid="MRK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7"/>Wɛɛ làkyen kàlakyään alɔŋki ande, anà Petɔlà sye, naa: "Nde amàkaladil u Ngalilɛ. Bɛ làyàkun'man kwo, asànaa kàlakyään nde." » <verse eid="MRK 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8"/>Apan, ba bàtoo, waa bàtiin ukwɛl a an'dii, ntɔn matɛɛr anà lingyoomà màkyer awal. Ba bàkyään anki itàkal undiir mwɛy akà mbuur umwɛy, ntɔn ba bàkäl u bɔɔmà.<verse eid="MRK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu an'kàmɛnà akà Màlye un'nsi Magàdalà</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Màt 28.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Ywn 20.11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9"/>Ungö a ngwiiyà ande kà ilä atàtwɛb kyà mpɔsà u tutu, Yɛsu kàtwab akàmɛnà akà Màlye un'nsi Magàdalà awà kàböŋ nde an'dwelà an'be, an'dweelà nsambwaar. <verse eid="MRK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10"/>Nde kàkàkyään ndaa ayi akà baar bàkälà anà nde. Ba bàkälà u ngyɛb anà mulelà. <verse eid="MRK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11"/>Wɛɛ mpal bàwem ba nde wàmutɛɛnà naa: « Yɛsu wà anà mɔ̈ɔ̈, mɛ in'kyun'man! », ba bun'si anki làkwikilà.<verse eid="MRK 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu an'kàmɛnà akà alɔŋki abɔ̈ɔ̈l</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luk 24.13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12"/>Ungö apan, Yɛsu kàkàmɛnà ifà asin akalɔŋki abɔ̈ɔ̈l bàkäl u mbwo mukyà ndwaŋ. <verse eid="MRK 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13"/>Ba bàyàfurà, waa bàkyään ya akà bumwɛy. Wɛɛ ba, ba sye basi anki làkwikilà.<verse eid="MRK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu an'kàmɛnà akà Bàkwem Aŋimwɛy</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Màt 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24.36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Ywn 20.19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Ian 1.6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14"/>Ungö apan, Yɛsu kàkàmɛnà akà Bàkwem Aŋimwɛy umpal bàkäl ba mudyà, waa kapɛl ntɔn bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n ba làkwikilà anà ntɔn bwoor a mpem aba bàtön ba mukyey baar bun'mɛn wàŋàwiyà. <verse eid="MRK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15"/>Nde waa kàtɛn a ba naa: « Làkyen u mɛɛn manswà mukyään Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ akà nkyeer yanswà. <verse eid="MRK 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16"/>Mbuur asàsà làkwikilà anà asàwal ndüümà, nde asàwà mɔ̈ɔ̈, wɛɛ mbuur mpa asàsà làkwikilà, nde bàsun'tsüül mbar. <verse eid="MRK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17"/>Làler idiim isaswaŋà naa baar bà bàkyàsà làkwikilà: Kà ikɔb amɛ ba bàsàböŋ insɔŋà, ba bàsàtɛn ndaa a kün, <verse eid="MRK 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18"/>ba bàsàtà ntäy mpi kà an'kɔɔ, bàsànwà ipöm, wɛɛ kyà ube isakyer anki, ba bàsàsà abɛy an'kɔɔ, waa ba bàsàkɔɔrà. »<verse eid="MRK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsu kan'furà akà Taa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luk 24.50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Ian 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19"/>Abun, ungö muyäm anà ba, Mwol Yɛsu bun'syen du, waa kàbwaay u kɔɔ a Nzam là ibaal. <verse eid="MRK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20"/>Wɛɛ akà ba, ba bàkyen mukàkyään Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ u mɛɛn manswà. Mwol kàsälà anà ba, waa kàtää imbäl u mbwo a idiim a impà kàkyerà nde muswaŋ naa an'lɔɔŋ aba mà ndandaa.<verse eid="MRK 16:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16"/>
</usx>
